(264632, 17848, 6771, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic.  I do like the muted colors, but not as fond of the noise.  Still a very good shot</td>', 'Very dramatic.  I do like the muted colors, but not as fond of the noise.  Still a very good shot', '2003-04-14 01:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(264640, 18163, 6771, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the fog, and lowlight capture.  Some graininess, which is to be expected with lowlight and decreasing the size of the photo.  I like the light trails from the one building on the mid left.  Cool</td>', 'Nice capture of the fog, and lowlight capture.  Some graininess, which is to be expected with lowlight and decreasing the size of the photo.  I like the light trails from the one building on the mid left.  Cool', '2003-04-14 01:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(264641, 18120, 117, '<td valign="top">excellent detail I like this one-10</td>', 'excellent detail I like this one-10', '2003-04-14 01:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(264642, 17646, 6771, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  Time to saddle up the backpack!!  Crisp and clear focus and DOF.  Great color on the water</td>', 'Stunning.  Time to saddle up the backpack!!  Crisp and clear focus and DOF.  Great color on the water', '2003-04-14 01:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(264650, 17645, 6771, '<td valign="top">Nice catch!  I would like to see the DOF/focus a touch more on the deer, with the upstage most trees not quite in focus.  Nice</td>', 'Nice catch!  I would like to see the DOF/focus a touch more on the deer, with the upstage most trees not quite in focus.  Nice', '2003-04-14 01:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(264653, 17985, 6900, '<td valign="top">Looks like a great area to take sky/landscape/storm shots from!  Nice capture of the variety of colors.</td>', 'Looks like a great area to take sky/landscape/storm shots from!  Nice capture of the variety of colors.', '2003-04-14 01:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(264654, 18265, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great macro, colors and focus.  Like to see the end of that yelllow (stamen?) in the pic, otherwise great!!</td>', 'Great macro, colors and focus.  Like to see the end of that yelllow (stamen?) in the pic, otherwise great!!', '2003-04-14 01:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(264656, 17853, 5333, '<td valign="top">Your title higlights it but it''s too small....</td>', 'Your title higlights it but it''s too small....', '2003-04-14 01:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(264657, 18187, 6771, '<td valign="top">Love this subject!  Nice composition with Ranier centered.  The colors seem dull and on the magenta/pusplish side.  I would like to see the crisp white of the snow.</td>', 'Love this subject!  Nice composition with Ranier centered.  The colors seem dull and on the magenta/pusplish side.  I would like to see the crisp white of the snow.', '2003-04-14 01:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(264660, 17919, 6900, '<td valign="top">Great shot of the effects of weather!</td>', 'Great shot of the effects of weather!', '2003-04-14 01:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(264665, 18201, 6771, '<td valign="top">Intense shot in black and white.  Very good focus/DOF.  How was this one in color?</td>', 'Intense shot in black and white.  Very good focus/DOF.  How was this one in color?', '2003-04-14 01:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(264669, 18076, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great silhouette and lighting.  I would like to see just a touch more brightness (mainly on the ominous cloud) to see more detail in it.  Nice catch</td>', 'Great silhouette and lighting.  I would like to see just a touch more brightness (mainly on the ominous cloud) to see more detail in it.  Nice catch', '2003-04-14 01:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(264673, 17902, 6771, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective, dropping off the bottom half of the vane.  Great blue sky.  Is there much detail on the horse.  Would like to see a touch more light on it to see.</td>', 'Interesting perspective, dropping off the bottom half of the vane.  Great blue sky.  Is there much detail on the horse.  Would like to see a touch more light on it to see.', '2003-04-14 02:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(264674, 18053, 5333, '<td valign="top">Besides the noise this is a winner in my eyes!!  Nice clours in the sky, and the composition..</td>', 'Besides the noise this is a winner in my eyes!!  Nice clours in the sky, and the composition..', '2003-04-14 02:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(264677, 17981, 6388, '<td valign="top">i tried using a mirror for a shot like this too - the double drops are a  bit distracting.  I never did find a way around it.  good effort anyway.</td>', 'i tried using a mirror for a shot like this too - the double drops are a  bit distracting.  I never did find a way around it.  good effort anyway.', '2003-04-14 02:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(264680, 17921, 7300, '<td valign="top">Scary......... Cool........... But, with a sense of hope Very Nice!!</td>', 'Scary......... Cool........... But, with a sense of hope Very Nice!!', '2003-04-14 02:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(264691, 18116, 117, '<td valign="top">nice name or so it seems</td>', 'nice name or so it seems', '2003-04-14 02:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(264703, 18100, 5333, '<td valign="top">Very nice..only that the land is a bit dark...7</td>', 'Very nice..only that the land is a bit dark...7', '2003-04-14 02:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(264706, 18122, 5333, '<td valign="top">Wow, great macro...better stil if a bit of it broke of and flown in the wind ...still a 10 of course</td>', 'Wow, great macro...better stil if a bit of it broke of and flown in the wind ...still a 10 of course', '2003-04-14 02:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(264722, 17946, 3946, '<td valign="top">Would have been more dramatic with more constrast.</td>', 'Would have been more dramatic with more constrast.', '2003-04-14 02:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(264724, 18059, 6771, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors and representation.  Good detail</td>', 'Excellent colors and representation.  Good detail', '2003-04-14 02:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(264726, 18188, 6405, '<td valign="top">Looks like me last Saturday! LOL 7 here!</td>', 'Looks like me last Saturday! LOL 7 here!', '2003-04-14 02:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(264729, 17953, 3946, '<td valign="top">Very interesting!!  Too bad the lights of the city are so bright.  It takes away from the lightening.</td>', 'Very interesting!!  Too bad the lights of the city are so bright.  It takes away from the lightening.', '2003-04-14 02:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(264730, 18087, 6771, '<td valign="top">Nice representaion of weather.  Good white snow.  The tree seems to be just a touch out of focus.</td>', 'Nice representaion of weather.  Good white snow.  The tree seems to be just a touch out of focus.', '2003-04-14 02:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(264734, 18040, 3946, '<td valign="top">Very good take on the challenge.  I think I''m seeing the cut marks on the wood where it''s hard to see the ring detail.  That''s unfortunate</td>', 'Very good take on the challenge.  I think I''m seeing the cut marks on the wood where it''s hard to see the ring detail.  That''s unfortunate', '2003-04-14 02:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(264736, 18246, 6771, '<td valign="top">I like the compostion and the way the upper and lower half are balanced.  The white area is a touch bright, and has destroyed some detail in those clouds.  Not sure how well the "landscape" setting captured this.  Most of the photo has a soft focus to it.</td>', 'I like the compostion and the way the upper and lower half are balanced.  The white area is a touch bright, and has destroyed some detail in those clouds.  Not sure how well the "landscape" setting captured this.  Most of the photo has a soft focus to it.', '2003-04-14 02:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(264737, 18128, 6771, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture, with the silhouetted trees.</td>', 'Very nice capture, with the silhouetted trees.', '2003-04-14 02:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(264738, 17987, 6771, '<td valign="top">Let it snow.  Nice technical shot with an interesting perspective and crop.</td>', 'Let it snow.  Nice technical shot with an interesting perspective and crop.', '2003-04-14 02:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(264740, 18267, 6771, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection photo.  Sure shows a dreary, rainy day.</td>', 'Nice reflection photo.  Sure shows a dreary, rainy day.', '2003-04-14 02:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(264742, 18054, 3946, '<td valign="top">I love this shot!!  Good take on the challenge.  He appears to have been very satisfied with his/her swim.</td>', 'I love this shot!!  Good take on the challenge.  He appears to have been very satisfied with his/her swim.', '2003-04-14 02:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(264748, 17947, 6771, '<td valign="top">this looks like a very good shot, with the lighting and shadows.  Hard to tell the rest.  Start off with the 640 pixel (longest side), and adjust the quality down to get under the 150kb size.  My rule of thumb.  I will drop the size down if the quality setting drops below 80%, and then the size never below 512 pixels on the longest side.  Hope it helps.  Looks like a great photo.</td>', 'this looks like a very good shot, with the lighting and shadows.  Hard to tell the rest.  Start off with the 640 pixel (longest side), and adjust the quality down to get under the 150kb size.  My rule of thumb.  I will drop the size down if the quality setting drops below 80%, and then the size never below 512 pixels on the longest side.  Hope it helps.  Looks like a great photo.', '2003-04-14 02:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(264754, 17620, 6771, '<td valign="top">Very nice catch!  I love doing these out in front of my house.  THis would make a cool Pi submit.  LOL.<br/>I think cropping out some of the top part that is black would give a better affect.</td>', 'Very nice catch!  I love doing these out in front of my house.  THis would make a cool Pi submit.  LOL.I think cropping out some of the top part that is black would give a better affect.', '2003-04-14 02:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(264755, 17601, 5822, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the colors and composition of this photo, but don''t feel it meets the weather challenge.</td>', 'I absolutely love the colors and composition of this photo, but don''t feel it meets the weather challenge.', '2003-04-14 02:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(264759, 18116, 6202, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo of a weathered building but the title takes away, kind of gives it a negative  feeling.</td>', 'Very nice photo of a weathered building but the title takes away, kind of gives it a negative  feeling.', '2003-04-14 02:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(264760, 17646, 5822, '<td valign="top">I just love those cool colors. Very well done shot.</td>', 'I just love those cool colors. Very well done shot.', '2003-04-14 02:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(264763, 18188, 6771, '<td valign="top">Feel like I am back on the farm.  Great DOF, especially catching that sow pinching one off.  Hysterical!!<br/>The sky has a cyan tone to it, but I have encountered this with the web colors frequently.  Very good</td>', 'Feel like I am back on the farm.  Great DOF, especially catching that sow pinching one off.  Hysterical!!The sky has a cyan tone to it, but I have encountered this with the web colors frequently.  Very good', '2003-04-14 02:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(264766, 17658, 6771, '<td valign="top">Weather is there.  Not sure if you tryed to oversharpen, but there is a lot of weird artifact within the photo, especially around the bright drops.  looks like little crosshatches all over the picture</td>', 'Weather is there.  Not sure if you tryed to oversharpen, but there is a lot of weird artifact within the photo, especially around the bright drops.  looks like little crosshatches all over the picture', '2003-04-14 02:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(264770, 18117, 6771, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic.  I would like to see the brightness toned down a bit.  Smaller aperture maybe.  Bring out the clouds a bit more.</td>', 'Very dramatic.  I would like to see the brightness toned down a bit.  Smaller aperture maybe.  Bring out the clouds a bit more.', '2003-04-14 02:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(264772, 17798, 117, '<td valign="top">need to straighten out the horzion it''s tilted to the left</td>', 'need to straighten out the horzion it''s tilted to the left', '2003-04-14 03:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(264774, 17864, 6892, '<td valign="top">For all the stormy appearance of the clouds, the water seems placid (the trees are reflected in what appears to be calm water.)</td>', 'For all the stormy appearance of the clouds, the water seems placid (the trees are reflected in what appears to be calm water.)', '2003-04-14 03:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(264775, 17919, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great colors!!  The focus appears just a bit beyond the dead fall,  and in the water.  Would a vertical shot or crop have gotten more of the tree in  and then it disappearing out the corner?</td>', 'Great colors!!  The focus appears just a bit beyond the dead fall,  and in the water.  Would a vertical shot or crop have gotten more of the tree in  and then it disappearing out the corner?', '2003-04-14 03:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(264776, 18122, 5822, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely wonderful shot! I especially like the fine detail and muted colors. Only thing is I do not think this shot says weather in any way.</td>', 'This is an absolutely wonderful shot! I especially like the fine detail and muted colors. Only thing is I do not think this shot says weather in any way.', '2003-04-14 03:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(264777, 18126, 6892, '<td valign="top">It is the unsaid hint of spring that makes this unusual and bright.</td>', 'It is the unsaid hint of spring that makes this unusual and bright.', '2003-04-14 03:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(264778, 17807, 6892, '<td valign="top">Beautiful how mountains seem to draw the weather to them.</td>', 'Beautiful how mountains seem to draw the weather to them.', '2003-04-14 03:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(264780, 18009, 6892, '<td valign="top">This fulfills well the effects of weather, sometimes very unpleasant!</td>', 'This fulfills well the effects of weather, sometimes very unpleasant!', '2003-04-14 03:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(264784, 17798, 6892, '<td valign="top">Good duality: dark clouds and white caps.</td>', 'Good duality: dark clouds and white caps.', '2003-04-14 03:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
