(265367, 18244, 6424, '<td valign="top">very nice how did you get that shot? Good job 10</td>', 'very nice how did you get that shot? Good job 10', '2003-04-14 11:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(265368, 17880, 6424, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2003-04-14 11:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(265372, 17855, 6444, '<td valign="top">good job</td>', 'good job', '2003-04-14 11:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(265374, 18160, 5728, '<td valign="top">Well done! This pic has charachter. The longer shutter speed has really done this image justice. The stringy raindrops look fantastic, the deep yellow and green tops it all off. The Shallow DOF has the background blurred perfectly, this is an excellent photo, one you can really be proud of!</td>', 'Well done! This pic has charachter. The longer shutter speed has really done this image justice. The stringy raindrops look fantastic, the deep yellow and green tops it all off. The Shallow DOF has the background blurred perfectly, this is an excellent photo, one you can really be proud of!', '2003-04-14 11:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(265376, 17947, 6424, '<td valign="top">very nice image. good job</td>', 'very nice image. good job', '2003-04-14 11:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(265380, 17601, 6444, '<td valign="top">good job</td>', 'good job', '2003-04-14 11:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(265381, 18248, 917, '<td valign="top">I feel it should be zoomed in on the buildings more.</td>', 'I feel it should be zoomed in on the buildings more.', '2003-04-14 11:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(265382, 18118, 5728, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors! The siloheutted city skyline looks spooky with the few lights already lit in one line at the bottom. Is that ice on the water? Good job - 9.</td>', 'Awesome colors! The siloheutted city skyline looks spooky with the few lights already lit in one line at the bottom. Is that ice on the water? Good job - 9.', '2003-04-14 11:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(265383, 18186, 917, '<td valign="top">Try and get the kite flyer into shot too.</td>', 'Try and get the kite flyer into shot too.', '2003-04-14 11:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(265384, 18240, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow decent sky! Those clouds look wild. The image looks a little grainy at the top, but works okay here - 9.</td>', 'Wow decent sky! Those clouds look wild. The image looks a little grainy at the top, but works okay here - 9.', '2003-04-14 11:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(265385, 18275, 5728, '<td valign="top">Choice capture, looks like the beginnings of a tornado. Good crop, clever - 9.</td>', 'Choice capture, looks like the beginnings of a tornado. Good crop, clever - 9.', '2003-04-14 11:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(265387, 18090, 5728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors. That sky looks pretty wild, I also like the effect of end of the peninsula still bathed in sunlet. A tad grainy in the top clouds tho - 9.</td>', 'Beautiful colors. That sky looks pretty wild, I also like the effect of end of the peninsula still bathed in sunlet. A tad grainy in the top clouds tho - 9.', '2003-04-14 11:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(265390, 17921, 5728, '<td valign="top">Amazing capture you got here! This is nearly poster/postcard material. Get it ready for selling as a print for sure. Excellent contrasts and those suns rays are awesome. The darkness in the lower left hand corner unbalances this photo a little - 9.</td>', 'Amazing capture you got here! This is nearly poster/postcard material. Get it ready for selling as a print for sure. Excellent contrasts and those suns rays are awesome. The darkness in the lower left hand corner unbalances this photo a little - 9.', '2003-04-14 11:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(265391, 18092, 917, '<td valign="top">Erm,they cant be May flowers. Try turning the camera through 90 degrees and locating the brat more to the left of frame (as the gaze here is from left to right). Then you wont be cropping the head and arm so much. You also need to fill in that big black space over the shoulder there.  Not a big score Im afraid, as the connection is a bit tenous, but dont despair, my entry this week is suffering a similar fate.</td>', 'Erm,they cant be May flowers. Try turning the camera through 90 degrees and locating the brat more to the left of frame (as the gaze here is from left to right). Then you wont be cropping the head and arm so much. You also need to fill in that big black space over the shoulder there.  Not a big score Im afraid, as the connection is a bit tenous, but dont despair, my entry this week is suffering a similar fate.', '2003-04-14 11:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(265395, 18233, 5728, '<td valign="top">Amazing sky good catpture, you''ve got a good eye. The starry effect of the sun behind the building balances this photo wonderfully! Is that a water fountain on the right? Personally, I would have left it out of the shot, but that''s just me - 9.</td>', 'Amazing sky good catpture, you''ve got a good eye. The starry effect of the sun behind the building balances this photo wonderfully! Is that a water fountain on the right? Personally, I would have left it out of the shot, but that''s just me - 9.', '2003-04-14 11:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(265397, 17937, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wicked sky and excellent shot! The stary glare of the sun is the biggest plus point in this photo. Without the sun there this image would have been dull and unbalanced. Good job on the choice composition - 9.</td>', 'Wicked sky and excellent shot! The stary glare of the sun is the biggest plus point in this photo. Without the sun there this image would have been dull and unbalanced. Good job on the choice composition - 9.', '2003-04-14 11:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(265399, 17846, 917, '<td valign="top">Horizon not level. Its quite brave to try and show a heavily overcast day.</td>', 'Horizon not level. Its quite brave to try and show a heavily overcast day.', '2003-04-14 11:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(265401, 18152, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow killer colors here and what a wild sky! I''m not sure I would have centered everything the way you have, I would have placed the sun in one of the lower thirds either left or right following the rule of thirds - 9.</td>', 'Wow killer colors here and what a wild sky! I''m not sure I would have centered everything the way you have, I would have placed the sun in one of the lower thirds either left or right following the rule of thirds - 9.', '2003-04-14 11:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(265403, 18257, 5728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Challenge met twice over here, that sure is weather, why don''t I get anything like that here? (9)</td>', 'Beautiful! Challenge met twice over here, that sure is weather, why don''t I get anything like that here? (9)', '2003-04-14 12:00:20.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(265404, 17742, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wasn''t that a handy place to be this week, in the Sahara! Excellent idea and well composed, I lift my hat to you - 9.</td>', 'Wasn''t that a handy place to be this week, in the Sahara! Excellent idea and well composed, I lift my hat to you - 9.', '2003-04-14 12:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(265406, 18188, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now this is funny, you''ve got a good imagination and a keen eye. Good job, you deserve a high ranking with this - 9.</td>', 'Now this is funny, you''ve got a good imagination and a keen eye. Good job, you deserve a high ranking with this - 9.', '2003-04-14 12:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(265408, 17863, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Those water drops are so in focus and crispy sharp, awesome! And you got some refraction in them as well, plus the very shallow DOF is making them even sharper still. Congratulations on an amazing shot!</td>', 'Excellent! Those water drops are so in focus and crispy sharp, awesome! And you got some refraction in them as well, plus the very shallow DOF is making them even sharper still. Congratulations on an amazing shot!', '2003-04-14 12:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(265409, 17816, 5728, '<td valign="top">Did something happen to your photo while you were uploading it or is it meant to be like this? I''m missing something here.</td>', 'Did something happen to your photo while you were uploading it or is it meant to be like this? I''m missing something here.', '2003-04-14 12:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(265411, 17640, 5728, '<td valign="top">Ummm, what is it exactly? Bad weather perhaps? It must be such bad weather I can''t really make it out.</td>', 'Ummm, what is it exactly? Bad weather perhaps? It must be such bad weather I can''t really make it out.', '2003-04-14 12:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(265412, 18149, 5728, '<td valign="top">Oh yes, old and weather beaten, poor horse. Interesting crop.</td>', 'Oh yes, old and weather beaten, poor horse. Interesting crop.', '2003-04-14 12:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(265416, 17719, 5728, '<td valign="top">Weather? Okay I suppose it beats just taking a photo of a plain blue sky right. It''s a tad grainy in the background but the flag seems fine, nice cropping.</td>', 'Weather? Okay I suppose it beats just taking a photo of a plain blue sky right. It''s a tad grainy in the background but the flag seems fine, nice cropping.', '2003-04-14 12:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(265417, 17915, 6458, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.. this looks very similar to an idea I had. Good shot! Only change I would have made would be to have the subject looking at his watch.</td>', 'Hmmm.. this looks very similar to an idea I had. Good shot! Only change I would have made would be to have the subject looking at his watch.', '2003-04-14 12:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(265421, 18183, 7242, '<td valign="top">This does look like a postcard. Nice!</td>', 'This does look like a postcard. Nice!', '2003-04-14 12:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(265423, 18128, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is like one of those photos you''d find on travel magazines. The suns rays give a decent effect shining across the water like that, the sky in its many colors looks awesome. Nice natural framing using the plants. My only niggle would be that the sun is too centered in the image. I would have had it placed a third of the way over to the left or right.</td>', 'This is like one of those photos you''d find on travel magazines. The suns rays give a decent effect shining across the water like that, the sky in its many colors looks awesome. Nice natural framing using the plants. My only niggle would be that the sun is too centered in the image. I would have had it placed a third of the way over to the left or right.', '2003-04-14 12:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(265424, 18141, 5728, '<td valign="top">Great image, everything fully in focus. The composition is excellent and the slightly longer shutter speed was a good decision, choice!</td>', 'Great image, everything fully in focus. The composition is excellent and the slightly longer shutter speed was a good decision, choice!', '2003-04-14 12:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(265425, 18066, 5728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, get this one ready for selling cos you will. Perfect composition and the water drop is so sharp, and stands out even more due to your shallow DOF.</td>', 'Beautiful, get this one ready for selling cos you will. Perfect composition and the water drop is so sharp, and stands out even more due to your shallow DOF.', '2003-04-14 12:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(265426, 18034, 5728, '<td valign="top">I was trying to think of a way to depict wind and couldn''t think of anything decent. But you have, and you''ve done it very well too, good shot.</td>', 'I was trying to think of a way to depict wind and couldn''t think of anything decent. But you have, and you''ve done it very well too, good shot.', '2003-04-14 12:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(265427, 18181, 5728, '<td valign="top">I want to be right there right now! You''ve made me envious with this shot, thank you. I like it, awesome with that negative space and the tree leaning into the middle of the image. Be proud of this shot.</td>', 'I want to be right there right now! You''ve made me envious with this shot, thank you. I like it, awesome with that negative space and the tree leaning into the middle of the image. Be proud of this shot.', '2003-04-14 12:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(265428, 17736, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Composition is amazing, shallow DOF and all the important parts sharp and in focus, good job.</td>', 'Excellent! Composition is amazing, shallow DOF and all the important parts sharp and in focus, good job.', '2003-04-14 12:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(265430, 18083, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wild sky! Good capture you have a good eye.</td>', 'Wild sky! Good capture you have a good eye.', '2003-04-14 12:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(265431, 17978, 5728, '<td valign="top">You''ve got a good eye! The crop is interesting, effective!</td>', 'You''ve got a good eye! The crop is interesting, effective!', '2003-04-14 12:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(265432, 17660, 5728, '<td valign="top">Last of the winter snows, good one. The colors are amazing, they really highlight the contrast between winter and spring.</td>', 'Last of the winter snows, good one. The colors are amazing, they really highlight the contrast between winter and spring.', '2003-04-14 12:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(265433, 18207, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is very inviting! Could be a picture on a postcard, and it''s full of weather, well done.</td>', 'This is very inviting! Could be a picture on a postcard, and it''s full of weather, well done.', '2003-04-14 12:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(265435, 17864, 5728, '<td valign="top">Bad weather coming on in. This is a very good photo, if only those powerlines weren''t in the way.</td>', 'Bad weather coming on in. This is a very good photo, if only those powerlines weren''t in the way.', '2003-04-14 12:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(265438, 18113, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s one firey sky you captured there. Looks fantastic, and the silohuette of the hills gives this image so much impact.</td>', 'Wow, that''s one firey sky you captured there. Looks fantastic, and the silohuette of the hills gives this image so much impact.', '2003-04-14 12:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(265439, 18276, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good sharpness, nice drops. I think I''d prefer it in colour, though.</td>', 'Good sharpness, nice drops. I think I''d prefer it in colour, though.', '2003-04-14 12:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(265440, 17905, 3290, '<td valign="top">Would work better in an open space without the netting.</td>', 'Would work better in an open space without the netting.', '2003-04-14 12:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(265441, 18037, 5728, '<td valign="top">Houston we have a problem: Weather! Excellent colors you captured, the different color layers from top to bottom are very effective.</td>', 'Houston we have a problem: Weather! Excellent colors you captured, the different color layers from top to bottom are very effective.', '2003-04-14 12:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(265443, 18246, 3290, '<td valign="top">Looks unsharp. Camera shake?</td>', 'Looks unsharp. Camera shake?', '2003-04-14 12:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(265448, 18267, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is certainly a different perspective on weather, but very clever and very effective. Great composition, well done!</td>', 'This is certainly a different perspective on weather, but very clever and very effective. Great composition, well done!', '2003-04-14 12:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(265453, 17816, 3290, '<td valign="top">Looks like the image is corrupted?</td>', 'Looks like the image is corrupted?', '2003-04-14 12:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
