(265771, 18081, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing photo, I love the crisp blue sky and marshmellow type clouds. I have the impression those sticks are just trying to reach out and join in. Well done! The only thing I would have changed is the stick on the far left. I''d either have cropped it completely out or moved back a little to get it also reaching upwards.</td>', 'This is an amazing photo, I love the crisp blue sky and marshmellow type clouds. I have the impression those sticks are just trying to reach out and join in. Well done! The only thing I would have changed is the stick on the far left. I''d either have cropped it completely out or moved back a little to get it also reaching upwards.', '2003-04-14 15:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
