(266009, 18242, 3669, '<td valign="top">Couldn''t have pulled this shot off without the bird.  Very nice capture.  The picture just goes on and on with something to look at all levels.  The "island" in the background on the left to the bird in the middle to the rocks in the foreground.  I love it! On my computer, I have to scroll to see all areas of the picture.  I wish I didn''t have to do that so that I could see it as a whole.  Is a must with this one, but that''s my problem.</td>', 'Couldn''t have pulled this shot off without the bird.  Very nice capture.  The picture just goes on and on with something to look at all levels.  The "island" in the background on the left to the bird in the middle to the rocks in the foreground.  I love it! On my computer, I have to scroll to see all areas of the picture.  I wish I didn''t have to do that so that I could see it as a whole.  Is a must with this one, but that''s my problem.', '2003-04-14 17:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(266010, 18182, 3607, '<td valign="top">is this the best weather picture you could get of rio?  i have i expectations from you for the flora (the green stuff growing on the mountains) and the fauna (the gatinhas gathering on the beaches) for the current challenges ;-)  boa sorte meu irmao!</td>', 'is this the best weather picture you could get of rio?  i have i expectations from you for the flora (the green stuff growing on the mountains) and the fauna (the gatinhas gathering on the beaches) for the current challenges ;-)  boa sorte meu irmao!', '2003-04-14 17:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(266015, 17669, 3607, '<td valign="top">i like the tree growing in the boat.  a slight boost in saturation might have made a nice red/grey contrast.</td>', 'i like the tree growing in the boat.  a slight boost in saturation might have made a nice red/grey contrast.', '2003-04-14 17:07:41.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(266016, 18233, 3607, '<td valign="top">very nice.  use of the flash might have made the fountain come out a bit more (although maybe not better. . .)</td>', 'very nice.  use of the flash might have made the fountain come out a bit more (although maybe not better. . .)', '2003-04-14 17:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(266018, 17676, 7438, '<td valign="top">Too much murky water, not enough beautiful sky</td>', 'Too much murky water, not enough beautiful sky', '2003-04-14 17:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(266023, 17990, 3607, '<td valign="top">yum - looks like a tequila sunrise!</td>', 'yum - looks like a tequila sunrise!', '2003-04-14 17:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(266025, 17703, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, however I would have liked to see it cropped a little closer.  The lamp is the main subject so cropping a little to the left of it, keeping the areas below and above, but then extending right to include the illuminated portion of the bush.  I''d like to see you try that and see what you think.  The light source (the lamp) shows the sleet falling which I think is the dramatic part.  All the wasted space takes away from the drama.  As you can probably tell, I''ve spent a lot of time on this photo...I really like it.</td>', 'Very nice picture, however I would have liked to see it cropped a little closer.  The lamp is the main subject so cropping a little to the left of it, keeping the areas below and above, but then extending right to include the illuminated portion of the bush.  I''d like to see you try that and see what you think.  The light source (the lamp) shows the sleet falling which I think is the dramatic part.  All the wasted space takes away from the drama.  As you can probably tell, I''ve spent a lot of time on this photo...I really like it.', '2003-04-14 17:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(266029, 18257, 5044, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome sky, but I would have liked it more if I had been able to see the land as well. You must have had a good reason to crop it out. Almost a perfect shot.</td>', 'This is an awesome sky, but I would have liked it more if I had been able to see the land as well. You must have had a good reason to crop it out. Almost a perfect shot.', '2003-04-14 17:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(266032, 18241, 5044, '<td valign="top">Contrast is too high, IMO.</td>', 'Contrast is too high, IMO.', '2003-04-14 17:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(266033, 17817, 5044, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but without the title, this says nothing.</td>', 'Sorry, but without the title, this says nothing.', '2003-04-14 17:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(266034, 18259, 5044, '<td valign="top">Cool.</td>', 'Cool.', '2003-04-14 17:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(266035, 17957, 4767, '<td valign="top">Ouch!</td>', 'Ouch!', '2003-04-14 17:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(266038, 17605, 4517, '<td valign="top">Your horizons not very level. Just kidding i think this is a superb shot, i almost feel seasick looking at it. 10 2 u</td>', 'Your horizons not very level. Just kidding i think this is a superb shot, i almost feel seasick looking at it. 10 2 u', '2003-04-14 17:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(266040, 18183, 4517, '<td valign="top">Postcard shot. I can`t fault it. 10</td>', 'Postcard shot. I can`t fault it. 10', '2003-04-14 17:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(266041, 17746, 3669, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of the sun showing the bursts of light surrounding it.  I like the positioning of the windmill.  The problem is, there is a lot of wasted space here.  I think some cropping could really do this photo a lot of justice by putting more emphasis on the drama.</td>', 'Beautiful capture of the sun showing the bursts of light surrounding it.  I like the positioning of the windmill.  The problem is, there is a lot of wasted space here.  I think some cropping could really do this photo a lot of justice by putting more emphasis on the drama.', '2003-04-14 17:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(266042, 18117, 4517, '<td valign="top">One of the best examples of crepuscular rays i`ve seen.10</td>', 'One of the best examples of crepuscular rays i`ve seen.10', '2003-04-14 17:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(266044, 18134, 3669, '<td valign="top">Oh wow.  A lot of distruction here caused from weather so good use of the challenge.  The blurriness, though, is causing distruction of your score of your picture in this challenge.</td>', 'Oh wow.  A lot of distruction here caused from weather so good use of the challenge.  The blurriness, though, is causing distruction of your score of your picture in this challenge.', '2003-04-14 17:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(266045, 17798, 4517, '<td valign="top">Great photo but i can only guess at how many people have told you to straighten up your horizon.</td>', 'Great photo but i can only guess at how many people have told you to straighten up your horizon.', '2003-04-14 17:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(266046, 18222, 4517, '<td valign="top">You call that rust. You should see my car. Nice macro.</td>', 'You call that rust. You should see my car. Nice macro.', '2003-04-14 17:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(266049, 18149, 4517, '<td valign="top">Maybe should have taken a step or two back to get the whole head in.</td>', 'Maybe should have taken a step or two back to get the whole head in.', '2003-04-14 17:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(266051, 17625, 4517, '<td valign="top">crepuscular rays make great photos 9</td>', 'crepuscular rays make great photos 9', '2003-04-14 17:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(266053, 18197, 4517, '<td valign="top">Hope your camera wasn`t too badly damaged.</td>', 'Hope your camera wasn`t too badly damaged.', '2003-04-14 17:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(266055, 18250, 4517, '<td valign="top">Underground weather effects, excellent idea and photo. 9</td>', 'Underground weather effects, excellent idea and photo. 9', '2003-04-14 17:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(266057, 17651, 4517, '<td valign="top">Very flat, bland looking sky and quite pixelated. Overall a very dull photo but keep trying.</td>', 'Very flat, bland looking sky and quite pixelated. Overall a very dull photo but keep trying.', '2003-04-14 17:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(266059, 17736, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice!  Good composition, focus and depth.  You were able to show nice texture and detail of the leaf.  Just might be a tad on the dark side.  Simple adjustment to brightness/constast could bring the colors out more.</td>', 'Nice!  Good composition, focus and depth.  You were able to show nice texture and detail of the leaf.  Just might be a tad on the dark side.  Simple adjustment to brightness/constast could bring the colors out more.', '2003-04-14 18:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(266060, 18265, 4517, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure where the weather is but nice image.</td>', 'Not quite sure where the weather is but nice image.', '2003-04-14 18:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(266063, 17690, 4411, '<td valign="top">A shame it''s blacked out at the top, but it gives a great impression of a strong wind.<br/>Nicely composed and I like the colour. Good focus/sharpness on the tail. Nice shot, well done.</td>', 'A shame it''s blacked out at the top, but it gives a great impression of a strong wind.Nicely composed and I like the colour. Good focus/sharpness on the tail. Nice shot, well done.', '2003-04-14 18:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(266064, 18160, 4517, '<td valign="top">Look at the angle of that rain, it must of been so windy and sunny too.<br/>If that rain was real i would have turned round to shot the rainbow. I like. 9</td>', 'Look at the angle of that rain, it must of been so windy and sunny too.If that rain was real i would have turned round to shot the rainbow. I like. 9', '2003-04-14 18:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(266066, 17956, 4517, '<td valign="top">Evil looking clouds.Good luck 7</td>', 'Evil looking clouds.Good luck 7', '2003-04-14 18:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(266067, 17921, 7073, '<td valign="top">Very great shot!  This is definitely one to remember!</td>', 'Very great shot!  This is definitely one to remember!', '2003-04-14 18:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(266068, 18090, 616, '<td valign="top">This is an incredibly beautiful shot. Too bad there was so much of an over cast that day. This shot would have been a lot nicer if the sun was laying over the area to give more light and saturation.</td>', 'This is an incredibly beautiful shot. Too bad there was so much of an over cast that day. This shot would have been a lot nicer if the sun was laying over the area to give more light and saturation.', '2003-04-14 18:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(266069, 18038, 4411, '<td valign="top">Shame the focus is behind the squirrel, and that he''s right at the bottom of the frame. Would have been a great shot otherwise. Still, I know how difficult these fellas are to catch on camera so well done for that.</td>', 'Shame the focus is behind the squirrel, and that he''s right at the bottom of the frame. Would have been a great shot otherwise. Still, I know how difficult these fellas are to catch on camera so well done for that.', '2003-04-14 18:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(266070, 17742, 7073, '<td valign="top">Love the colors... nice shot!</td>', 'Love the colors... nice shot!', '2003-04-14 18:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(266071, 18191, 4517, '<td valign="top">One of the better flag pics. Would be nice to see a different now and again but i won`t score that against you. 6</td>', 'One of the better flag pics. Would be nice to see a different now and again but i won`t score that against you. 6', '2003-04-14 18:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(266076, 17915, 4517, '<td valign="top">Looks like one of those old film camares round his neck. Oh those were the days, the bad old days :-) Nice shot 8</td>', 'Looks like one of those old film camares round his neck. Oh those were the days, the bad old days :-) Nice shot 8', '2003-04-14 18:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
