(266087, 17746, 4411, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of things I like in this shot - the ''beams'' on the sun (how do you do that?!), the impression of motion on the turbine (or is that just me?!) and the dramatic clouds.<br/>The only thing I don''t like is the clump of trees on the right, I would crop those off.<br/>Great shot, well done.</td>', 'There''s a lot of things I like in this shot - the ''beams'' on the sun (how do you do that?!), the impression of motion on the turbine (or is that just me?!) and the dramatic clouds.The only thing I don''t like is the clump of trees on the right, I would crop those off.Great shot, well done.', '2003-04-14 18:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(266088, 18117, 7073, '<td valign="top">very interesting!</td>', 'very interesting!', '2003-04-14 18:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(266089, 17798, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but I would like to see the horizon as a straight line. You''ve captured a nice scene here.</td>', 'Nice shot but I would like to see the horizon as a straight line. You''ve captured a nice scene here.', '2003-04-14 18:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(266090, 17792, 7461, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what this is</td>', 'I can''t tell what this is', '2003-04-14 18:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
