(266116, 18233, 4411, '<td valign="top">Love the ''star'' effect on the sun, I wanna know how to do it!<br/>The only downside to this shot is that the water coming from the fountain looks more like mud! A combination of it being dark and the red light.<br/>Still, a great shot, and I do like that sun : )</td>', 'Love the ''star'' effect on the sun, I wanna know how to do it!The only downside to this shot is that the water coming from the fountain looks more like mud! A combination of it being dark and the red light.Still, a great shot, and I do like that sun : )', '2003-04-14 18:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(266117, 18194, 7073, '<td valign="top">very cool.</td>', 'very cool.', '2003-04-14 18:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(266118, 18145, 4517, '<td valign="top">The title is a bit of a mouthfull, maybe `melting` would have done but the photo is good and different, which is good with so many pics of just sky. Good luck</td>', 'The title is a bit of a mouthfull, maybe `melting` would have done but the photo is good and different, which is good with so many pics of just sky. Good luck', '2003-04-14 18:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(266120, 17684, 7073, '<td valign="top">awesome!  There may be something lurking in the water!  :)<br/>Lovely shot!</td>', 'awesome!  There may be something lurking in the water!  :)Lovely shot!', '2003-04-14 18:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(266122, 18250, 7073, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2003-04-14 18:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
