(266131, 17946, 7073, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot!</td>', 'Awesome shot!', '2003-04-14 18:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(266132, 17957, 4411, '<td valign="top">Not Brighton pier *again*!!! How cliche. LOL.<br/>Now that I''ve got that outta my system, this is the best shot I''ve seen of the collapsed pier yet. Wow, that''s one heck of a mess. Mother nature will always win in the end.<br/>Great shot, well done.</td>', 'Not Brighton pier *again*!!! How cliche. LOL.Now that I''ve got that outta my system, this is the best shot I''ve seen of the collapsed pier yet. Wow, that''s one heck of a mess. Mother nature will always win in the end.Great shot, well done.', '2003-04-14 18:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(266136, 18100, 7073, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2003-04-14 18:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(266139, 18159, 7461, '<td valign="top">seems like the focus is a little blurry.</td>', 'seems like the focus is a little blurry.', '2003-04-14 18:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(266140, 18053, 4411, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this, and the silhouetted shapes, but the sky does absolutely nothing for me. Shame, a more natural sky would have scored much better.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this, and the silhouetted shapes, but the sky does absolutely nothing for me. Shame, a more natural sky would have scored much better.', '2003-04-14 18:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(266141, 17660, 7073, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Reminds me of here.  Great colors too!</td>', 'Great shot!  Reminds me of here.  Great colors too!', '2003-04-14 18:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(266142, 18108, 3669, '<td valign="top">I really like the way the leaf seems to be "popping" out of the picture.  The focus and depth is great.  I don''t really care for the title you chose...a rain shower is more refreashing than acidic.  However, the glare on the many of the raindrops is distracting.  The drop at the tip of the main leaf is the best.  Wish they all could have looked like that one.</td>', 'I really like the way the leaf seems to be "popping" out of the picture.  The focus and depth is great.  I don''t really care for the title you chose...a rain shower is more refreashing than acidic.  However, the glare on the many of the raindrops is distracting.  The drop at the tip of the main leaf is the best.  Wish they all could have looked like that one.', '2003-04-14 18:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(266143, 17902, 7073, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot!!  At first I thought it was a real horse, LOL!</td>', 'Awesome shot!!  At first I thought it was a real horse, LOL!', '2003-04-14 18:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
