(266486, 18039, 7599, '<td valign="top">This picture is geat. I love how you have "presented" the weather. Original, fun and technically great. (How on earth did you ever get your side mirror that clean?)</td>', 'This picture is geat. I love how you have "presented" the weather. Original, fun and technically great. (How on earth did you ever get your side mirror that clean?)', '2003-04-14 22:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(266501, 17703, 6597, '<td valign="top">The light makes this a stronger photograph</td>', 'The light makes this a stronger photograph', '2003-04-14 22:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(266503, 17709, 6597, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured those dark clouds real good</td>', 'You''ve captured those dark clouds real good', '2003-04-14 22:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(266504, 18108, 6597, '<td valign="top">good texture</td>', 'good texture', '2003-04-14 22:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(266505, 18018, 6597, '<td valign="top">good composition The blue creeping in the corner adds to the photograph</td>', 'good composition The blue creeping in the corner adds to the photograph', '2003-04-14 22:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(266508, 18054, 6597, '<td valign="top">good texture</td>', 'good texture', '2003-04-14 22:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(266509, 18186, 7599, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this photo, I do however think it could have been improved by a closer shot.</td>', 'I like the idea of this photo, I do however think it could have been improved by a closer shot.', '2003-04-14 22:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(266511, 17891, 7599, '<td valign="top">I''m not really getting the weather in this photo. It strikes me more as a "time of day" type photo.</td>', 'I''m not really getting the weather in this photo. It strikes me more as a "time of day" type photo.', '2003-04-14 22:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(266513, 18242, 933, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  The line from the rocks draws the eye towards the bird and the shoreline.  very nicely done.  7 md</td>', 'Very nice composition.  The line from the rocks draws the eye towards the bird and the shoreline.  very nicely done.  7 md', '2003-04-14 22:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(266514, 17623, 6597, '<td valign="top">I like the raindrops</td>', 'I like the raindrops', '2003-04-14 22:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(266515, 17985, 7599, '<td valign="top">Great clouds. I find the snow area a bit too white, and undefined. Excellent show of weather though.</td>', 'Great clouds. I find the snow area a bit too white, and undefined. Excellent show of weather though.', '2003-04-14 22:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(266517, 17705, 6597, '<td valign="top">raindrops are good</td>', 'raindrops are good', '2003-04-14 22:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(266518, 17721, 7599, '<td valign="top">Very unique.</td>', 'Very unique.', '2003-04-14 22:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(266519, 17848, 933, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Love the texture and mood of this photo.  Very nice.  8 md</td>', 'Wow.  Love the texture and mood of this photo.  Very nice.  8 md', '2003-04-14 22:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(266520, 18181, 933, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.  Not sure if it completely works though.  Tree seems a bit soft.  6 md</td>', 'Interesting composition.  Not sure if it completely works though.  Tree seems a bit soft.  6 md', '2003-04-14 23:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(266521, 18092, 7599, '<td valign="top">Great picture, very cute. In my personal opinion though, it doesn''t totally meet the challenge 100%, although I do get the concept "effects of weather" you are trying to convey. I think if the picture had less focus ont he child and more on the flowers, it wouldn''t have been such a stretch.</td>', 'Great picture, very cute. In my personal opinion though, it doesn''t totally meet the challenge 100%, although I do get the concept "effects of weather" you are trying to convey. I think if the picture had less focus ont he child and more on the flowers, it wouldn''t have been such a stretch.', '2003-04-14 23:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(266522, 17690, 933, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  Nice use of b/w (duotone?).  Good composition.  Nice border.  Good feel and character to this image.  Only knock is that the back of the sign is a bit washed out.  Very well done!!  9 md</td>', 'Great photo.  Nice use of b/w (duotone?).  Good composition.  Nice border.  Good feel and character to this image.  Only knock is that the back of the sign is a bit washed out.  Very well done!!  9 md', '2003-04-14 23:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(266525, 17651, 7599, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the composition of this picture. I like the theory behind it, but think maybe a simplified version (skip the truck) or even just a crop that shows just the top of the trees would be more effective.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the composition of this picture. I like the theory behind it, but think maybe a simplified version (skip the truck) or even just a crop that shows just the top of the trees would be more effective.', '2003-04-14 23:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(266529, 18246, 7599, '<td valign="top">The only thing I would change about this photo would be the shadowing in the clouds. The white is a little too white, theres not a lot of definition. Still, completely meets the challenges and you have a great eye for colour.</td>', 'The only thing I would change about this photo would be the shadowing in the clouds. The white is a little too white, theres not a lot of definition. Still, completely meets the challenges and you have a great eye for colour.', '2003-04-14 23:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(266531, 18155, 7599, '<td valign="top">I really like the light in the background that looks like it''s coming from a lightbouse. It''s a shame there''s the moon reflection. I think the centering in this photo is well planned, really works well.</td>', 'I really like the light in the background that looks like it''s coming from a lightbouse. It''s a shame there''s the moon reflection. I think the centering in this photo is well planned, really works well.', '2003-04-14 23:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(266532, 18122, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro shot..I''ll have to give you that.  The lighting is perfect and there is great detail and focus.  It''s a magnificant shot, however, I don''t see the effects of weather here.  Now, if perhaps, you could have gotten lucky and photographed one of the "puffs" being blowen off by the wind, then yes, you would have met the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice macro shot..I''ll have to give you that.  The lighting is perfect and there is great detail and focus.  It''s a magnificant shot, however, I don''t see the effects of weather here.  Now, if perhaps, you could have gotten lucky and photographed one of the "puffs" being blowen off by the wind, then yes, you would have met the challenge.', '2003-04-14 23:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(266535, 18094, 7599, '<td valign="top">I love the softnes in this photo. I find the dark area on the left lower corner a bit too much, but overall great job!</td>', 'I love the softnes in this photo. I find the dark area on the left lower corner a bit too much, but overall great job!', '2003-04-14 23:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(266536, 18267, 6938, '<td valign="top">Might have been  more interesting to see a bird or person through the rain-drops.<br/>(is this through a car window?) You have captured the droplets, and mood realy well.</td>', 'Might have been  more interesting to see a bird or person through the rain-drops.(is this through a car window?) You have captured the droplets, and mood realy well.', '2003-04-14 23:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(266538, 17957, 7599, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic picture. It''s sharp, interesting, and deserves a high score. Some of the images so far have kinda stretched the "effects of weather" in my mind, but this one leaves no doubt. Best of luck, this one is one of my faves.</td>', 'This is a fantastic picture. It''s sharp, interesting, and deserves a high score. Some of the images so far have kinda stretched the "effects of weather" in my mind, but this one leaves no doubt. Best of luck, this one is one of my faves.', '2003-04-14 23:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(266540, 18140, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice shot.  I don''t particularily like the bold border around the picture.  It takes away from the haziness of the subject.  Fog should go on and on.  Should have been a lighter color, much thinner, or no border at all.</td>', 'Very, very nice shot.  I don''t particularily like the bold border around the picture.  It takes away from the haziness of the subject.  Fog should go on and on.  Should have been a lighter color, much thinner, or no border at all.', '2003-04-14 23:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(266543, 18159, 7599, '<td valign="top">At first glance the greyness of the land kinda turned me off of the overall picture. However, after looking at it for a few minutes I now think it completely enhances the picture. I really like the fence in the corner too, don''t know why, I just like it.</td>', 'At first glance the greyness of the land kinda turned me off of the overall picture. However, after looking at it for a few minutes I now think it completely enhances the picture. I really like the fence in the corner too, don''t know why, I just like it.', '2003-04-14 23:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(266544, 18018, 7599, '<td valign="top">Nice, I love the contrast.</td>', 'Nice, I love the contrast.', '2003-04-14 23:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(266545, 18161, 3669, '<td valign="top">This is one shot that should have been saved for the fauna challenge.  It''s such a cute and well done photo.  You are really stretching by trying to fit this picture into this challenge.  I would have voted a 10 had it been in the fauna challenge.  That''s how good this one is.  DOF is great and the expression on the squirrel''s face is priceless.</td>', 'This is one shot that should have been saved for the fauna challenge.  It''s such a cute and well done photo.  You are really stretching by trying to fit this picture into this challenge.  I would have voted a 10 had it been in the fauna challenge.  That''s how good this one is.  DOF is great and the expression on the squirrel''s face is priceless.', '2003-04-14 23:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(266546, 17742, 7599, '<td valign="top">Very simple, it completely works! The marks in the sand, make the picture in my mind. They keep it from being too perfect.</td>', 'Very simple, it completely works! The marks in the sand, make the picture in my mind. They keep it from being too perfect.', '2003-04-14 23:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(266547, 18050, 3669, '<td valign="top">Ended up with a colorful abstract photo.  I probably would have cropped off the drabby top and right side of the photo.  Otherwise, nice.</td>', 'Ended up with a colorful abstract photo.  I probably would have cropped off the drabby top and right side of the photo.  Otherwise, nice.', '2003-04-14 23:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(266548, 17681, 7599, '<td valign="top">I''m biased I grew up on a golf course. This one speaks to me =)</td>', 'I''m biased I grew up on a golf course. This one speaks to me =)', '2003-04-14 23:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(266550, 17905, 3669, '<td valign="top">Oversharpened?  Too much artifact.  Very good idea, but the result is not eye pleasing.</td>', 'Oversharpened?  Too much artifact.  Very good idea, but the result is not eye pleasing.', '2003-04-14 23:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(266551, 18252, 7599, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but in my mind a bit of the stretch to meet the challenge. It isn''t weather, or an effect of weather, more an object used in weather. But you could have taken a picture of many things in that case. A coat, mittens, shoes, a frisbee, picnic basket.. Lot of objects we use in different types of weather, but not weather.  Marks for the quality of the photo though.</td>', 'Nice shot, but in my mind a bit of the stretch to meet the challenge. It isn''t weather, or an effect of weather, more an object used in weather. But you could have taken a picture of many things in that case. A coat, mittens, shoes, a frisbee, picnic basket.. Lot of objects we use in different types of weather, but not weather.  Marks for the quality of the photo though.', '2003-04-14 23:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(266553, 18220, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like this one.  Good focus on the rain drops.</td>', 'Nice, I like this one.  Good focus on the rain drops.', '2003-04-14 23:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(266554, 17884, 7599, '<td valign="top">Love the composition. This is a great photo!</td>', 'Love the composition. This is a great photo!', '2003-04-14 23:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(266556, 18187, 7599, '<td valign="top">I personaly think the colours are a little off in this picture. But meets the weather aspect of the challenge and the shape and shadows of the clouds are great.</td>', 'I personaly think the colours are a little off in this picture. But meets the weather aspect of the challenge and the shape and shadows of the clouds are great.', '2003-04-14 23:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(266558, 17981, 3669, '<td valign="top">This might be weird of me to ask, but why are the rain patterns all in pairs?  Makes it seems unnatural to me.  Not that it needs to be, but distracting, nonetheless.</td>', 'This might be weird of me to ask, but why are the rain patterns all in pairs?  Makes it seems unnatural to me.  Not that it needs to be, but distracting, nonetheless.', '2003-04-14 23:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(266559, 18207, 7599, '<td valign="top">This would be a great stock photo, I can see it being used for any number of advertising purposes. Great colours.</td>', 'This would be a great stock photo, I can see it being used for any number of advertising purposes. Great colours.', '2003-04-14 23:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(266561, 17953, 3669, '<td valign="top">The bright lights of the city kind of took away from the drama in the sky.  Nice photo otherwise.</td>', 'The bright lights of the city kind of took away from the drama in the sky.  Nice photo otherwise.', '2003-04-14 23:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(266562, 18076, 7599, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast in this picture.</td>', 'Nice contrast in this picture.', '2003-04-14 23:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(266568, 18149, 7599, '<td valign="top">A bit of a stretch to meet the challenge. Would be better technically if the picture were a bit sharper.</td>', 'A bit of a stretch to meet the challenge. Would be better technically if the picture were a bit sharper.', '2003-04-14 23:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(266573, 18140, 7599, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Excellent composition.</td>', 'Great photo. Excellent composition.', '2003-04-14 23:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(266576, 18112, 326, '<td valign="top">Great Shot!</td>', 'Great Shot!', '2003-04-14 23:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(266579, 17640, 7599, '<td valign="top">Not getting this one at all.</td>', 'Not getting this one at all.', '2003-04-14 23:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(266581, 18167, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  I like the angle that it was shot at.  Nicely focused and shows depth.  Does meet challenge.  Will score high, I''m sure.  Good luck this week.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  I like the angle that it was shot at.  Nicely focused and shows depth.  Does meet challenge.  Will score high, I''m sure.  Good luck this week.', '2003-04-14 23:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(266583, 17669, 7599, '<td valign="top">Looks like this one has been on a much longer tour then 3 hours.</td>', 'Looks like this one has been on a much longer tour then 3 hours.', '2003-04-14 23:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(266586, 18260, 7599, '<td valign="top">I think I would have put the objects on a plain background to make the colours pop. Also it''s a bit of a stretch for the challenge in my mind.</td>', 'I think I would have put the objects on a plain background to make the colours pop. Also it''s a bit of a stretch for the challenge in my mind.', '2003-04-14 23:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(266588, 18254, 3669, '<td valign="top">Duck shows a lot of attitude!  Obviously being wind blown.  Focus is good.  It''s just a bit dark.  Could use some adjustments for improvment.</td>', 'Duck shows a lot of attitude!  Obviously being wind blown.  Focus is good.  It''s just a bit dark.  Could use some adjustments for improvment.', '2003-04-14 23:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
