(266881, 17640, 4494, '<td valign="top">It''s way to abstract, and I like abstract more then most (here anyway).  I''ll be very interested to see how this does.  I''d give this a 6.  But I bet the overall will be much lower.</td>', 'It''s way to abstract, and I like abstract more then most (here anyway).  I''ll be very interested to see how this does.  I''d give this a 6.  But I bet the overall will be much lower.', '2003-04-15 01:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
