(266890, 17864, 4494, '<td valign="top">I love it.  I''m no expert on B&amp;W but I''m sure this is a perfect example of a great one.  Please tell me how to do it!  (The blacks and whites so pure like that).  Awsome!  9.</td>', 'I love it.  I''m no expert on B&W but I''m sure this is a perfect example of a great one.  Please tell me how to do it!  (The blacks and whites so pure like that).  Awsome!  9.', '2003-04-15 02:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(266892, 18041, 4494, '<td valign="top">Yeah... April showers bring April snow storms. :)  Looks like the dead of winter there!!</td>', 'Yeah... April showers bring April snow storms. :)  Looks like the dead of winter there!!', '2003-04-15 02:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(266893, 17987, 5044, '<td valign="top">LOL, I hope that''s not your jeep!</td>', 'LOL, I hope that''s not your jeep!', '2003-04-15 02:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
