(266896, 17632, 4494, '<td valign="top">Wow that''s truely awsome looking.  Very powerfull cloud shot!!  The "tiny" airplanes in the background give the shot so much perspective.  10.  Whoot, a possible winner here.</td>', 'Wow that''s truely awsome looking.  Very powerfull cloud shot!!  The "tiny" airplanes in the background give the shot so much perspective.  10.  Whoot, a possible winner here.', '2003-04-15 02:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
