(266914, 18117, 7751, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. The sun looks like it is raining down on the pier. Love this angle. One of my favorites so far.</td>', 'This is beautiful. The sun looks like it is raining down on the pier. Love this angle. One of my favorites so far.', '2003-04-15 02:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(266915, 18269, 7751, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to be able to see more of the landscape....and where was this taken. Those mountains look familiar.</td>', 'I would have liked to be able to see more of the landscape....and where was this taken. Those mountains look familiar.', '2003-04-15 02:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(266917, 18141, 7751, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful photo. Don''t know how you could improve it. Maybe a different border, but the photo itself is great.</td>', 'This is a wonderful photo. Don''t know how you could improve it. Maybe a different border, but the photo itself is great.', '2003-04-15 02:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(266919, 18275, 7751, '<td valign="top">Wow, the way those two cloud fronts lay over each other....it''s amazing. The lighter clouds look like mountains. From the thumbnail it looks like this is the star of a tornado.</td>', 'Wow, the way those two cloud fronts lay over each other....it''s amazing. The lighter clouds look like mountains. From the thumbnail it looks like this is the star of a tornado.', '2003-04-15 02:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(266929, 17620, 7396, '<td valign="top">i luv how dark this is...</td>', 'i luv how dark this is...', '2003-04-15 03:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(266930, 17912, 3669, '<td valign="top">This picture has kept moving up my score list as the day has gone on.  It started out as an 8 and now it''s at a 10 now that I''m done with all the photos.  I scored it lower at first because I felt that it was a little dark and maybe cropped a little too close.  But now I feel that the close crop is necessary.  It wouldn''t have the same "feel" and wouldn''t show the great detail of the water drops which is the main feature in this photo.  Above all, I like the fact that it''s unique, well focused and meets the challenge head on.  Very professional looking...you should score high.  Hopefully, I''ll see this in the top 3, if not first.  Good luck!</td>', 'This picture has kept moving up my score list as the day has gone on.  It started out as an 8 and now it''s at a 10 now that I''m done with all the photos.  I scored it lower at first because I felt that it was a little dark and maybe cropped a little too close.  But now I feel that the close crop is necessary.  It wouldn''t have the same "feel" and wouldn''t show the great detail of the water drops which is the main feature in this photo.  Above all, I like the fact that it''s unique, well focused and meets the challenge head on.  Very professional looking...you should score high.  Hopefully, I''ll see this in the top 3, if not first.  Good luck!', '2003-04-15 03:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(266932, 18151, 6308, '<td valign="top">i like what you captured here</td>', 'i like what you captured here', '2003-04-15 03:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(266933, 18090, 7751, '<td valign="top">Awesome. This must be water erosion. Very beautiful picture. I think it would make a great poster.</td>', 'Awesome. This must be water erosion. Very beautiful picture. I think it would make a great poster.', '2003-04-15 03:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(266934, 17798, 6855, '<td valign="top">A smidge off level.  Nice tone/contrast between the white of the sky and the white of the water.  This picture evokes my imagination.  Good Job!</td>', 'A smidge off level.  Nice tone/contrast between the white of the sky and the white of the water.  This picture evokes my imagination.  Good Job!', '2003-04-15 03:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(266935, 18233, 3669, '<td valign="top">The colors in this photo are magnificant.  Very nice capture and well done.  I love the reflection of color in the pool.  However, I''m not sure if I like the fountain showing in the photo.  The falling water winds up as a rusty blurr and distracts from the beautiful sunset and otherwise other "clean" features of this shot...not to mention the reflection streak.</td>', 'The colors in this photo are magnificant.  Very nice capture and well done.  I love the reflection of color in the pool.  However, I''m not sure if I like the fountain showing in the photo.  The falling water winds up as a rusty blurr and distracts from the beautiful sunset and otherwise other "clean" features of this shot...not to mention the reflection streak.', '2003-04-15 03:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(266936, 18132, 7751, '<td valign="top">Very creative....Could have been a bit more centered..</td>', 'Very creative....Could have been a bit more centered..', '2003-04-15 03:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(266937, 18156, 6855, '<td valign="top">I would have had trouble understanding this one without the title as a clue.  If there had been something identifiable to bring your subject into context, it may have provided the extra push to make this photo a real winner.</td>', 'I would have had trouble understanding this one without the title as a clue.  If there had been something identifiable to bring your subject into context, it may have provided the extra push to make this photo a real winner.', '2003-04-15 03:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(266938, 18247, 6771, '<td valign="top">Is this a "wave" in rock?  Very cool.  Definitely weather related.  It seems just a touch too bright for my taste.  Love the rust colors.  I do not like the red border, doesn''t matter for my votes though.</td>', 'Is this a "wave" in rock?  Very cool.  Definitely weather related.  It seems just a touch too bright for my taste.  Love the rust colors.  I do not like the red border, doesn''t matter for my votes though.', '2003-04-15 03:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
