(266942, 18133, 6771, '<td valign="top">CRUNCH!!  This in CO?  Seen plenty of that last month.  Nice representation.  The young lady''s face is a touch out of focus</td>', 'CRUNCH!!  This in CO?  Seen plenty of that last month.  Nice representation.  The young lady''s face is a touch out of focus', '2003-04-15 03:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(266943, 17981, 6855, '<td valign="top">Looks like spray on a mirror, and it looks like my son eveytime it rains.  Very nice use of a prop (if it is).  This photo captures a dreary day feeling nicely.</td>', 'Looks like spray on a mirror, and it looks like my son eveytime it rains.  Very nice use of a prop (if it is).  This photo captures a dreary day feeling nicely.', '2003-04-15 03:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
