(266950, 17869, 6771, '<td valign="top">Nice focus/DOF.  Lighting is touch bright on the cheek, but illustrates the sun a bit more.  Do not like the thick blue border, not that it effects my vote.</td>', 'Nice focus/DOF.  Lighting is touch bright on the cheek, but illustrates the sun a bit more.  Do not like the thick blue border, not that it effects my vote.', '2003-04-15 03:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
