(266953, 18160, 3669, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the falling rain.  Lighting is perfect, colors are vivid and subject is nicely focused.  The reflection of light on the water drops adds a nice touch.  Photo also has nice depth...the flowers appear to be popping right out of the picture.  Good luck...you should score nicely.</td>', 'Good capture of the falling rain.  Lighting is perfect, colors are vivid and subject is nicely focused.  The reflection of light on the water drops adds a nice touch.  Photo also has nice depth...the flowers appear to be popping right out of the picture.  Good luck...you should score nicely.', '2003-04-15 03:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(266955, 18187, 6855, '<td valign="top">I visit this area often, I like the shot.  I know that time was short for the challenge, but I''ve often seen a similar set-up with near blinding brilliant white off of the top of those clouds, set against the snow to make an incredible contrast of black/white.  Maybe you could sneak one of those into another challenge. =)</td>', 'I visit this area often, I like the shot.  I know that time was short for the challenge, but I''ve often seen a similar set-up with near blinding brilliant white off of the top of those clouds, set against the snow to make an incredible contrast of black/white.  Maybe you could sneak one of those into another challenge. =)', '2003-04-15 03:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(266956, 17947, 7396, '<td valign="top">wish this was bigger.it''s beautiful ...</td>', 'wish this was bigger.it''s beautiful ...', '2003-04-15 03:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(266960, 17689, 3669, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge.  This picture is clean and well focused.  The lighting is perfect and the colors are vivid.</td>', 'Good take on the challenge.  This picture is clean and well focused.  The lighting is perfect and the colors are vivid.', '2003-04-15 03:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(266961, 18233, 656, '<td valign="top">Good foreground interest but quite dark, giving an initially confusing silhouettes.  The sky is great, lovely colours and the stopped down aperture gives an interesting star effect to the sun.  Maybe some really low power fill to put some light into the fountain would be interesting, though it might ruin the mood</td>', 'Good foreground interest but quite dark, giving an initially confusing silhouettes.  The sky is great, lovely colours and the stopped down aperture gives an interesting star effect to the sun.  Maybe some really low power fill to put some light into the fountain would be interesting, though it might ruin the mood', '2003-04-15 03:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(266962, 18188, 6477, '<td valign="top">I like it! :) very nice picture</td>', 'I like it! :) very nice picture', '2003-04-15 03:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(266964, 17641, 6855, '<td valign="top">I felt like voting low just because you''re gloating the good weather while the rest of us suffer.   But, Alas, I do like the shot.  Maybe work with the angle a little bit.  The palms obscure the horizon line, which in this shot could have worked to your favor.</td>', 'I felt like voting low just because you''re gloating the good weather while the rest of us suffer.   But, Alas, I do like the shot.  Maybe work with the angle a little bit.  The palms obscure the horizon line, which in this shot could have worked to your favor.', '2003-04-15 03:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(266965, 18081, 7751, '<td valign="top">hehehe - Cute title. At least it spices up that blue sky a bit.</td>', 'hehehe - Cute title. At least it spices up that blue sky a bit.', '2003-04-15 03:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(266966, 18226, 6855, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot, not much weather, but the colors are spectacular.</td>', 'Stunning shot, not much weather, but the colors are spectacular.', '2003-04-15 03:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
