(266970, 18194, 6771, '<td valign="top">Thems look like Pheasant tracks.  Click, click!  Boom!   Yum, yum!!  Now I want pheasant season to come!  Nice focus and having white snow, even though the shadow make it appear gray.  Nice job</td>', 'Thems look like Pheasant tracks.  Click, click!  Boom!   Yum, yum!!  Now I want pheasant season to come!  Nice focus and having white snow, even though the shadow make it appear gray.  Nice job', '2003-04-15 03:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(266972, 17852, 6855, '<td valign="top">This photo works.  I stared at it for a while and decided that you deserve credit for having to suffer through this in April.  I suppose that the lack of focus IS the focus here...maybe work the angle on what is tangible in the picture a bit better, but I do like and it definitely is weather!</td>', 'This photo works.  I stared at it for a while and decided that you deserve credit for having to suffer through this in April.  I suppose that the lack of focus IS the focus here...maybe work the angle on what is tangible in the picture a bit better, but I do like and it definitely is weather!', '2003-04-15 03:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
