(267003, 18058, 5628, '<td valign="top">Interresting shot, nice use of DOF. Unfortunately it looks a little grainy. Too much contrast perhaps?</td>', 'Interresting shot, nice use of DOF. Unfortunately it looks a little grainy. Too much contrast perhaps?', '2003-04-15 04:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
