(267007, 18161, 7067, '<td valign="top">Cute little critter.  This is a good photograph (nice use of DOF, diffused lighting, nice highlights in the eyes, composition) but I don''t feel it meets the weather challenge.  I try to judge the merits of a photograph itself.  If I need the title to tie the submission to the challenge, then I don''t feel the submission qualifies for the challenge topic, which is the case here.</td>', 'Cute little critter.  This is a good photograph (nice use of DOF, diffused lighting, nice highlights in the eyes, composition) but I don''t feel it meets the weather challenge.  I try to judge the merits of a photograph itself.  If I need the title to tie the submission to the challenge, then I don''t feel the submission qualifies for the challenge topic, which is the case here.', '2003-04-15 04:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(267008, 18112, 7067, '<td valign="top">Without a doubt this is my favourite weather submission.  It''s going in as one of my favourite photos as soon as the voting is over.  That''s how much I like this!  The clouds are picture perfect, very soft looking, fluffly like white cotton candy, and possess both highlights and shadows.  I also like the slim strip of land shown on the bottom and the slight reflections of what appears to be a river or lake.  Fantastic shot!</td>', 'Without a doubt this is my favourite weather submission.  It''s going in as one of my favourite photos as soon as the voting is over.  That''s how much I like this!  The clouds are picture perfect, very soft looking, fluffly like white cotton candy, and possess both highlights and shadows.  I also like the slim strip of land shown on the bottom and the slight reflections of what appears to be a river or lake.  Fantastic shot!', '2003-04-15 04:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(267009, 18261, 7067, '<td valign="top">There are two distracting elements in this image: the electricity wires and the label on the water bottle.  I think this is a very great idea and illustrates well the effects of weather for me.  I like the accessories worn by the subject here and the colours of her skin, hair, straw hat against the blue sky background.</td>', 'There are two distracting elements in this image: the electricity wires and the label on the water bottle.  I think this is a very great idea and illustrates well the effects of weather for me.  I like the accessories worn by the subject here and the colours of her skin, hair, straw hat against the blue sky background.', '2003-04-15 04:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(267014, 18126, 7864, '<td valign="top">Lacks impact and clarity of the topic.</td>', 'Lacks impact and clarity of the topic.', '2003-04-15 05:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(267017, 17861, 7751, '<td valign="top">Good job on making this an interesting photo.  I think it would look better if the left corner was a little more in the shot.</td>', 'Good job on making this an interesting photo.  I think it would look better if the left corner was a little more in the shot.', '2003-04-15 05:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(267029, 18259, 3290, '<td valign="top">Interesting phenomenon. A shallower DOF would have isolated the curls from the house in the background.</td>', 'Interesting phenomenon. A shallower DOF would have isolated the curls from the house in the background.', '2003-04-15 05:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(267030, 17852, 5728, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah this is weather for sure! Good shot, and well done too. The way you have turned a simple photo of a couple benches, a rubbish bin and a tree into this fine shot is amazing. The crop of the tree is ideal, however I wouldn''t have left so much space on the left of the benches. The benches are a little too central here.</td>', 'Oh yeah this is weather for sure! Good shot, and well done too. The way you have turned a simple photo of a couple benches, a rubbish bin and a tree into this fine shot is amazing. The crop of the tree is ideal, however I wouldn''t have left so much space on the left of the benches. The benches are a little too central here.', '2003-04-15 05:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(267032, 17920, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now this is a fine shot! B&amp;W works here, the detail is amazing and those clouds are wild! The border appears a tad to thick though, maybe just my taste however :-)</td>', 'Now this is a fine shot! B&W works here, the detail is amazing and those clouds are wild! The border appears a tad to thick though, maybe just my taste however :-)', '2003-04-15 05:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(267033, 18100, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wild! A very good capture, well done. The clouds opening up to show the blues sky and sun''s ray shining through like a spotlight on the land is amazing.</td>', 'Wild! A very good capture, well done. The clouds opening up to show the blues sky and sun''s ray shining through like a spotlight on the land is amazing.', '2003-04-15 05:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(267034, 18182, 3290, '<td valign="top">A little dark in the shadows, but otherwise a pleasant scene.</td>', 'A little dark in the shadows, but otherwise a pleasant scene.', '2003-04-15 05:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(267035, 18140, 5728, '<td valign="top">Choice shot! The steps work well as leading lines here. Especially as they start at the bottom in full clarity and lead into the mistiness at the top, nice effect.</td>', 'Choice shot! The steps work well as leading lines here. Especially as they start at the bottom in full clarity and lead into the mistiness at the top, nice effect.', '2003-04-15 05:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(267036, 17977, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wild sky, angry clouds, good shot! I especially like the effect of the layering here, blue sky, clouds, blue sky, clouds. Works well!</td>', 'Wild sky, angry clouds, good shot! I especially like the effect of the layering here, blue sky, clouds, blue sky, clouds. Works well!', '2003-04-15 05:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(267037, 18126, 5728, '<td valign="top">Original! And well composed. Everything is in focus and the detail nice and sharp. Be proud of this one, I like it!</td>', 'Original! And well composed. Everything is in focus and the detail nice and sharp. Be proud of this one, I like it!', '2003-04-15 05:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(267039, 17844, 3290, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. Good focus, DOF and the backlighting is lovely. Well done.</td>', 'Very pretty. Good focus, DOF and the backlighting is lovely. Well done.', '2003-04-15 06:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(267040, 17984, 3290, '<td valign="top">Pretty. Nicely exposed and the drops are great.</td>', 'Pretty. Nicely exposed and the drops are great.', '2003-04-15 06:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
