(267053, 17651, 5728, '<td valign="top">Bad weather! You caught it well, I bet you had a miserable day seeing that out your window right? Maybe a little bit more focus may have helped.</td>', 'Bad weather! You caught it well, I bet you had a miserable day seeing that out your window right? Maybe a little bit more focus may have helped.', '2003-04-15 07:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(267054, 17603, 5728, '<td valign="top">Spring is coming believe me! Those are cool looking flowers. Nice effect with the snow on them, well done. I would have kept the whole flower in the pic and not cropped it out on the left side.</td>', 'Spring is coming believe me! Those are cool looking flowers. Nice effect with the snow on them, well done. I would have kept the whole flower in the pic and not cropped it out on the left side.', '2003-04-15 07:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(267055, 18038, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good shot with a nice composition. The squirrel is not fully in focus though, but very nearly!</td>', 'Good shot with a nice composition. The squirrel is not fully in focus though, but very nearly!', '2003-04-15 07:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(267056, 17912, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good cropping and depiction of the after effects of rainy weather, good job.</td>', 'Good cropping and depiction of the after effects of rainy weather, good job.', '2003-04-15 07:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(267057, 18018, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow what a contrast. Blue skies on the left and wild angry clouds on the right. Clever shot, you did well!</td>', 'Wow what a contrast. Blue skies on the left and wild angry clouds on the right. Clever shot, you did well!', '2003-04-15 07:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(267058, 18040, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now this is an original idea, good one. Especially with the crisp blue sky in the background.</td>', 'Now this is an original idea, good one. Especially with the crisp blue sky in the background.', '2003-04-15 07:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(267059, 17868, 5728, '<td valign="top">Don''t worry spring will get to you too :-) Good idea for a weather shot here. The pole or frame at the left is a little disturbing though, I would have either cropped it out or leaned more to the right to take the shot.</td>', 'Don''t worry spring will get to you too :-) Good idea for a weather shot here. The pole or frame at the left is a little disturbing though, I would have either cropped it out or leaned more to the right to take the shot.', '2003-04-15 07:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(267060, 18277, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good one! The shallow DOF works wonders here. This would look so amazing if your had got that large waterdrop full in focus! Still a good image though, well done.</td>', 'Good one! The shallow DOF works wonders here. This would look so amazing if your had got that large waterdrop full in focus! Still a good image though, well done.', '2003-04-15 07:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(267063, 18042, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good, but background is a distraction.</td>', 'Good, but background is a distraction.', '2003-04-15 07:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(267064, 18213, 3290, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Good lighting, DOF and exposure. Would like to see a close-up version of this for the structure of the icicles.</td>', 'Very nice. Good lighting, DOF and exposure. Would like to see a close-up version of this for the structure of the icicles.', '2003-04-15 07:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(267066, 17605, 3290, '<td valign="top">This is nice. Great perspective and the tilted horizon adds to its dynamism. Good use of B&amp;W too. I''d suggest cropping a little of the dark stuff away at the bottom - perhaps to the lowest horizontal rope? Will make a nice print for sailing buffs.</td>', 'This is nice. Great perspective and the tilted horizon adds to its dynamism. Good use of B&W too. I''d suggest cropping a little of the dark stuff away at the bottom - perhaps to the lowest horizontal rope? Will make a nice print for sailing buffs.', '2003-04-15 07:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(267067, 18054, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good catch. A lower viewpoint would make the dog stand out against the sky.</td>', 'Good catch. A lower viewpoint would make the dog stand out against the sky.', '2003-04-15 07:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(267068, 18056, 3290, '<td valign="top">Pretty colours, but a bit dark.</td>', 'Pretty colours, but a bit dark.', '2003-04-15 07:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(267069, 17625, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great effect and very pretty. The only problem is that the lighting is weird enough to make it look a but unreal. But this is a very nice shot.</td>', 'Great effect and very pretty. The only problem is that the lighting is weird enough to make it look a but unreal. But this is a very nice shot.', '2003-04-15 07:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(267070, 17620, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great catch. I would crop it so that the lightning is a much bigger piece of the picture.</td>', 'Great catch. I would crop it so that the lightning is a much bigger piece of the picture.', '2003-04-15 07:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(267071, 18142, 5728, '<td valign="top">Original idea, but effective. I like the thin crop making your photo look like a panarama pic,</td>', 'Original idea, but effective. I like the thin crop making your photo look like a panarama pic,', '2003-04-15 07:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(267072, 18132, 3290, '<td valign="top">Would have been really pretty backlit in a darkened room - the reflection on the glass spoils it somewhat.</td>', 'Would have been really pretty backlit in a darkened room - the reflection on the glass spoils it somewhat.', '2003-04-15 07:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(267073, 17798, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice but the tilted horizon is a distraction.</td>', 'Nice but the tilted horizon is a distraction.', '2003-04-15 07:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(267074, 17670, 5728, '<td valign="top">That sure is bad weather you got there. Interesting photo, the powerlines and powerpoles give it a kind of noisy look.</td>', 'That sure is bad weather you got there. Interesting photo, the powerlines and powerpoles give it a kind of noisy look.', '2003-04-15 07:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(267075, 18007, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice macro.</td>', 'Nice macro.', '2003-04-15 07:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(267076, 18148, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea and well done, you''ve made the frost look very crispy.</td>', 'Good idea and well done, you''ve made the frost look very crispy.', '2003-04-15 07:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(267077, 18145, 3290, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection.</td>', 'I like the reflection.', '2003-04-15 07:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(267078, 18035, 5728, '<td valign="top">Ah what a contrast, spring on the left and winter on the right. Good idea!</td>', 'Ah what a contrast, spring on the left and winter on the right. Good idea!', '2003-04-15 07:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(267079, 18257, 3290, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, but needs a little more space at the bottom.</td>', 'Very pretty, but needs a little more space at the bottom.', '2003-04-15 07:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(267080, 18194, 5728, '<td valign="top">Funny! Original! And well taken, but I wouldn''t have centered the tracks so exactly. I would have had them leading in from one of the sides.</td>', 'Funny! Original! And well taken, but I wouldn''t have centered the tracks so exactly. I would have had them leading in from one of the sides.', '2003-04-15 07:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(267081, 18248, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nicely clear, but I would crop out some of the empty sky.</td>', 'Nicely clear, but I would crop out some of the empty sky.', '2003-04-15 07:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(267084, 17625, 1717, '<td valign="top">stunning photo!  the colors are wonderful and it has a very emotional feel to it.  great job!  10 from me.</td>', 'stunning photo!  the colors are wonderful and it has a very emotional feel to it.  great job!  10 from me.', '2003-04-15 08:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(267088, 17798, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful stormy photograph.  The horizon is just a little bit tilted, but that can  easily be fixed with your favorite post processing software.</td>', 'This is a beautiful stormy photograph.  The horizon is just a little bit tilted, but that can  easily be fixed with your favorite post processing software.', '2003-04-15 08:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(267089, 18041, 1024, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition.  You have also managed to keep your whites very crisp.  Great job.</td>', 'Wonderful composition.  You have also managed to keep your whites very crisp.  Great job.', '2003-04-15 08:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(267092, 17798, 2798, '<td valign="top">Very moody and intense. Seems a little off-level though. Could also have used a focal point or some framing. 7- floyd</td>', 'Very moody and intense. Seems a little off-level though. Could also have used a focal point or some framing. 7- floyd', '2003-04-15 08:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
