(267294, 17854, 5728, '<td valign="top">The layering from light at the top to dark at the bottom is good, the silohuette of the tree and bushes is also very effective. But the tree being so centered takes a lot from this pic. It would have been better to place the tree to the left or right of the image.</td>', 'The layering from light at the top to dark at the bottom is good, the silohuette of the tree and bushes is also very effective. But the tree being so centered takes a lot from this pic. It would have been better to place the tree to the left or right of the image.', '2003-04-15 11:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
