(267329, 17847, 5728, '<td valign="top">This would be an excellent pic if you had cropped out that black at the top and bottom. Is that a border or window or something? Anyway the image has a soft quality to it. The layering of light to dark tones from the top to bottom works very well!</td>', 'This would be an excellent pic if you had cropped out that black at the top and bottom. Is that a border or window or something? Anyway the image has a soft quality to it. The layering of light to dark tones from the top to bottom works very well!', '2003-04-15 11:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
