(267433, 17632, 3102, '<td valign="top">Great colors!  Probably would have been better to include either more or less of the items at the bottom of the shot, though (airport?).</td>', 'Great colors!  Probably would have been better to include either more or less of the items at the bottom of the shot, though (airport?).', '2003-04-15 13:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
