(267439, 17640, 7778, '<td valign="top">This is a very refreshing change after looking at everything else. Of course, it is also very little. I''d imagine these pixels as part of a series perhaps, for interest and increased credibility?</td>', 'This is a very refreshing change after looking at everything else. Of course, it is also very little. I''d imagine these pixels as part of a series perhaps, for interest and increased credibility?', '2003-04-15 13:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
