(267442, 17846, 3102, '<td valign="top">Would have been awesome had the shot been leveled out a bit.  I feel like I''m sliding out of my chair as I view this, I''m afraid...</td>', 'Would have been awesome had the shot been leveled out a bit.  I feel like I''m sliding out of my chair as I view this, I''m afraid...', '2003-04-15 13:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(267444, 18276, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that B&amp;W adds to this one...</td>', 'I''m not sure that B&W adds to this one...', '2003-04-15 13:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(267445, 18050, 7778, '<td valign="top">Ah, this one''s fun. Even the window frames are dancing (shivering?).</td>', 'Ah, this one''s fun. Even the window frames are dancing (shivering?).', '2003-04-15 13:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(267448, 18136, 7778, '<td valign="top">What makes this shot, I think, is the available range of wather within a section of the sky. The colours, too, are unique considering the kind of day we''re having.<br/> <br/>The title, however, is way too trivial compared to the picture.</td>', 'What makes this shot, I think, is the available range of wather within a section of the sky. The colours, too, are unique considering the kind of day we''re having. The title, however, is way too trivial compared to the picture.', '2003-04-15 14:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(267449, 18049, 2764, '<td valign="top">A perfect 10</td>', 'A perfect 10', '2003-04-15 14:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(267452, 18156, 7778, '<td valign="top">The frame is too elaborate for the pic.</td>', 'The frame is too elaborate for the pic.', '2003-04-15 14:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(267453, 17620, 7510, '<td valign="top">Cool.  Not very centered (left to right).  I would have put the lightning right down the center line, and crop out the refelction(or whatever) at the bottom.  A little grainy.</td>', 'Cool.  Not very centered (left to right).  I would have put the lightning right down the center line, and crop out the refelction(or whatever) at the bottom.  A little grainy.', '2003-04-15 14:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(267455, 17762, 7510, '<td valign="top">Nice Idea.  I like the blue background, but there is a lot of shadow in this picture.  Maybe if you zoom into (or crop) a smaller area of trees/branches.  That would make the highlights more obvious, I think.  I don''t particularly like your choice of boarder.</td>', 'Nice Idea.  I like the blue background, but there is a lot of shadow in this picture.  Maybe if you zoom into (or crop) a smaller area of trees/branches.  That would make the highlights more obvious, I think.  I don''t particularly like your choice of boarder.', '2003-04-15 14:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(267457, 17851, 7510, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I can''t seem to focus on much of the picture, because the water distortion.  It hard on the eyes.</td>', 'Interesting.  I can''t seem to focus on much of the picture, because the water distortion.  It hard on the eyes.', '2003-04-15 14:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(267458, 18117, 7137, '<td valign="top">outstanding, i give you 10</td>', 'outstanding, i give you 10', '2003-04-15 14:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(267459, 17746, 7510, '<td valign="top">Nice Starburst.  Good Framing.  I''m not sure about the placement of the windmill.  I would have to see it from different angles to be sure.  The Sky looks wonderful, except at the right edge, it seems too dark.</td>', 'Nice Starburst.  Good Framing.  I''m not sure about the placement of the windmill.  I would have to see it from different angles to be sure.  The Sky looks wonderful, except at the right edge, it seems too dark.', '2003-04-15 14:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(267460, 17742, 7137, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture. colors, composition great. I have a hard time with the tire tracks. I would prefer to see the dunes untouched. 8</td>', 'I really like this picture. colors, composition great. I have a hard time with the tire tracks. I would prefer to see the dunes untouched. 8', '2003-04-15 14:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(267466, 18114, 7137, '<td valign="top">confused by the title</td>', 'confused by the title', '2003-04-15 14:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(267468, 17902, 7510, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I guess this is a weather vain.  I would have liked to see more of it, OR less (just have the horse).  The way it is framed the leaves (or whatever on either side of the horse) take away from the shot.  I find the boarder too overpowering.</td>', 'Interesting.  I guess this is a weather vain.  I would have liked to see more of it, OR less (just have the horse).  The way it is framed the leaves (or whatever on either side of the horse) take away from the shot.  I find the boarder too overpowering.', '2003-04-15 14:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(267469, 18081, 7510, '<td valign="top">Nice Colours.  Why are the branches cut?  Why did you take a picture of cut branches?  I don''t understand...  Oh well.  (5)</td>', 'Nice Colours.  Why are the branches cut?  Why did you take a picture of cut branches?  I don''t understand...  Oh well.  (5)', '2003-04-15 14:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(267473, 17601, 7137, '<td valign="top">beautiful picture, love the soft focus, dont get the title</td>', 'beautiful picture, love the soft focus, dont get the title', '2003-04-15 14:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(267474, 18050, 7510, '<td valign="top">Interesting Idea, but this photo just doesn''t seem to have any appeal.</td>', 'Interesting Idea, but this photo just doesn''t seem to have any appeal.', '2003-04-15 14:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(267476, 18222, 7137, '<td valign="top">Very neat idea. i like all aspects of this, but it''s been sharpened down to the pixel</td>', 'Very neat idea. i like all aspects of this, but it''s been sharpened down to the pixel', '2003-04-15 14:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(267477, 18126, 7137, '<td valign="top">really nice......clarity</td>', 'really nice......clarity', '2003-04-15 14:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(267478, 17682, 7137, '<td valign="top">good capture of erosion</td>', 'good capture of erosion', '2003-04-15 14:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(267479, 17919, 7510, '<td valign="top">Interesting shoot.  I think the shot would look better from a higher angle to show more of the tree.  I thinkg this is a little oversharpened, like in the grass and plants in the water.</td>', 'Interesting shoot.  I think the shot would look better from a higher angle to show more of the tree.  I thinkg this is a little oversharpened, like in the grass and plants in the water.', '2003-04-15 14:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(267481, 17682, 7510, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure this is the best angle for this shot.  The lines don''t seem to flow.  It looks a little oversharpened.</td>', 'I''m not sure this is the best angle for this shot.  The lines don''t seem to flow.  It looks a little oversharpened.', '2003-04-15 14:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(267482, 17920, 7137, '<td valign="top">really good. I think you''ve shown that B/W is one of the best ways to show dull winter/early spring landscapes. 8 good frame also.</td>', 'really good. I think you''ve shown that B/W is one of the best ways to show dull winter/early spring landscapes. 8 good frame also.', '2003-04-15 14:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
