(267484, 18248, 7510, '<td valign="top">I like the use of negitive space.  A little oversharpened, but it is hard to get a good shot of the rock from the wharf, unless you have a better zoom than I have.  Also I think the right side of the island is too dark.</td>', 'I like the use of negitive space.  A little oversharpened, but it is hard to get a good shot of the rock from the wharf, unless you have a better zoom than I have.  Also I think the right side of the island is too dark.', '2003-04-15 14:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(267486, 17947, 7137, '<td valign="top">good but small</td>', 'good but small', '2003-04-15 14:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(267487, 18219, 7510, '<td valign="top">Nice Shot.  I think maybe if you cropped a little more of the forground out, it would draw more focs on the Bird.  Not strongly weather related...</td>', 'Nice Shot.  I think maybe if you cropped a little more of the forground out, it would draw more focs on the Bird.  Not strongly weather related...', '2003-04-15 14:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(267488, 18183, 7137, '<td valign="top">looks like a postcard..great..call me anal, but check that horizon.....</td>', 'looks like a postcard..great..call me anal, but check that horizon.....', '2003-04-15 14:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(267489, 18009, 7510, '<td valign="top">Ha ha.  Ooops. I hope this isn''t your place.  I think you cropped this one a little too close to the top of the barn.</td>', 'Ha ha.  Ooops. I hope this isn''t your place.  I think you cropped this one a little too close to the top of the barn.', '2003-04-15 14:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(267490, 17902, 7137, '<td valign="top">more vane</td>', 'more vane', '2003-04-15 14:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(267492, 18227, 7510, '<td valign="top">I like it, but it would look a lot better if more of the forground was in focus.  I had this problem in the Symmetry Challenge, so I know how much of a pain it can be if your camera can''t focus close enough.  ;-)</td>', 'I like it, but it would look a lot better if more of the forground was in focus.  I had this problem in the Symmetry Challenge, so I know how much of a pain it can be if your camera can''t focus close enough.  ;-)', '2003-04-15 14:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(267495, 18220, 7510, '<td valign="top">Could you rearange the water drops into a nicer pattern?  Just Kidding.  I think if you got closer (bigger water drops) it would have more impact.</td>', 'Could you rearange the water drops into a nicer pattern?  Just Kidding.  I think if you got closer (bigger water drops) it would have more impact.', '2003-04-15 14:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(267496, 17709, 7510, '<td valign="top">The colours are a little muted.  I think a simpler boarder would have been better.</td>', 'The colours are a little muted.  I think a simpler boarder would have been better.', '2003-04-15 14:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(267500, 18159, 7510, '<td valign="top">Too dark.  I thinkif you moved the horizon to the lower third, it would have more impact.</td>', 'Too dark.  I thinkif you moved the horizon to the lower third, it would have more impact.', '2003-04-15 14:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(267505, 18204, 7510, '<td valign="top">Yes it''s blue.  Hmmm...  I like the gradient.  Interesting to look at for a while... Bold!(7)</td>', 'Yes it''s blue.  Hmmm...  I like the gradient.  Interesting to look at for a while... Bold!(7)', '2003-04-15 14:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(267508, 18140, 7510, '<td valign="top">I like the framing.  Nice lines.  The boarder is a nice touch.</td>', 'I like the framing.  Nice lines.  The boarder is a nice touch.', '2003-04-15 14:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(267512, 18060, 7510, '<td valign="top">Kind of grainy, but it looks like that is what you were going for.  I think a long narrow format (more on the sides), instead of the standard format, would have looked nicer.</td>', 'Kind of grainy, but it looks like that is what you were going for.  I think a long narrow format (more on the sides), instead of the standard format, would have looked nicer.', '2003-04-15 14:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(267515, 17868, 7369, '<td valign="top">A most uninteresting photo. You should have put more time in it; at least you could have gotten out of the building.</td>', 'A most uninteresting photo. You should have put more time in it; at least you could have gotten out of the building.', '2003-04-15 14:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(267516, 18056, 7510, '<td valign="top">Interesting colour.  I see some artifacting.  Too much of some kind of alteration (sharpening/compression/brightness/contrast), but I can''t tell which.  Also if you moved the horizon lower...</td>', 'Interesting colour.  I see some artifacting.  Too much of some kind of alteration (sharpening/compression/brightness/contrast), but I can''t tell which.  Also if you moved the horizon lower...', '2003-04-15 14:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(267519, 17736, 7510, '<td valign="top">Interesting shoot.  I''m not sure if the needles add or take away (I would have to see it both ways).  I like the DoF.</td>', 'Interesting shoot.  I''m not sure if the needles add or take away (I would have to see it both ways).  I like the DoF.', '2003-04-15 15:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(267525, 17981, 7510, '<td valign="top">The double image of the water doesn''t look right.  His right eye looks freaky, sorry to say.  I like the idea, especially the water streaming from his eyes, but overall I get a queasy feeling looking at this one.  I think this is pushing the limits of the Weather challenge.</td>', 'The double image of the water doesn''t look right.  His right eye looks freaky, sorry to say.  I like the idea, especially the water streaming from his eyes, but overall I get a queasy feeling looking at this one.  I think this is pushing the limits of the Weather challenge.', '2003-04-15 15:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(267528, 18265, 7369, '<td valign="top">At first I didn''t think this picture met the challenge. Then I saw the orange center, which resembles the sun, in a layer of white (clouds...). Perhaps I have a little too much imagination :p.</td>', 'At first I didn''t think this picture met the challenge. Then I saw the orange center, which resembles the sun, in a layer of white (clouds...). Perhaps I have a little too much imagination :p.', '2003-04-15 15:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(267529, 17721, 2146, '<td valign="top">that is cool...</td>', 'that is cool...', '2003-04-15 15:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(267530, 18160, 7369, '<td valign="top">Well done. The sense of speed in the raindrops is great.</td>', 'Well done. The sense of speed in the raindrops is great.', '2003-04-15 15:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(267532, 18100, 2146, '<td valign="top">very nice pretty shot</td>', 'very nice pretty shot', '2003-04-15 15:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(267533, 18140, 7369, '<td valign="top">This is a very mysterious photo. I like it.</td>', 'This is a very mysterious photo. I like it.', '2003-04-15 15:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(267534, 17677, 2146, '<td valign="top">love this shot</td>', 'love this shot', '2003-04-15 15:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
