(267634, 18233, 7510, '<td valign="top">I like the starburst.  The clouds are amazing.  It took me a couple of seconds to see that fountain.  I find it distracting, especially the flair in it.  You could probably loose the water altogether and frame the top left 2/3 of the photo.</td>', 'I like the starburst.  The clouds are amazing.  It took me a couple of seconds to see that fountain.  I find it distracting, especially the flair in it.  You could probably loose the water altogether and frame the top left 2/3 of the photo.', '2003-04-15 15:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
