(267639, 18226, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice title and image. The sky and water are both so beautiful, I can see why you put the horizon right in the middle. However, it might be fun to explore moving it either down or, with this title, up. Lovely and gentle.</td>', 'Nice title and image. The sky and water are both so beautiful, I can see why you put the horizon right in the middle. However, it might be fun to explore moving it either down or, with this title, up. Lovely and gentle.', '2003-04-15 15:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(267643, 17601, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really exciting light in this image. Sure made me stop. The title perplexes me a little, and the focus here is masterfully on the leaves, despite the light fence. Lovely shot! High marks.</td>', 'Really exciting light in this image. Sure made me stop. The title perplexes me a little, and the focus here is masterfully on the leaves, despite the light fence. Lovely shot! High marks.', '2003-04-15 15:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
