(267876, 18038, 7711, '<td valign="top">focu is a bit soft, we are losing some of the details of the squirrel''s fur, but I do like that sparkle in the snow.</td>', 'focu is a bit soft, we are losing some of the details of the squirrel''s fur, but I do like that sparkle in the snow.', '2003-04-15 18:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(267877, 17677, 6565, '<td valign="top">That''s just lovely!</td>', 'That''s just lovely!', '2003-04-15 18:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(267878, 18228, 7711, '<td valign="top">nice focus!</td>', 'nice focus!', '2003-04-15 18:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(267879, 18090, 7291, '<td valign="top">Wow, beautiful scenery.  You managed to caputure dark clouds and spots of sunshine off in the distance.  The trees are perfect because it add perspective and tell you just how big that cliff actually is.</td>', 'Wow, beautiful scenery.  You managed to caputure dark clouds and spots of sunshine off in the distance.  The trees are perfect because it add perspective and tell you just how big that cliff actually is.', '2003-04-15 18:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(267880, 17605, 7711, '<td valign="top">this is one of my top 3 of the week! I love the bw, and the composition cannot be improved upon in my humble opinion. The tilt really gives the feeling that we''re in the storm. My only beef is that the boat itself is a bit too dark, but still - 10 -</td>', 'this is one of my top 3 of the week! I love the bw, and the composition cannot be improved upon in my humble opinion. The tilt really gives the feeling that we''re in the storm. My only beef is that the boat itself is a bit too dark, but still - 10 -', '2003-04-15 18:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(267881, 18003, 7711, '<td valign="top">looks like the subject ought to be the rain falling from the gutter..would have been more effective if we could have captured them mid-fall in suspended animation, and if that isn''t the subject then... forgive my irrelevant comments!</td>', 'looks like the subject ought to be the rain falling from the gutter..would have been more effective if we could have captured them mid-fall in suspended animation, and if that isn''t the subject then... forgive my irrelevant comments!', '2003-04-15 18:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(267882, 18227, 7711, '<td valign="top">great idea! I would have cropped more of the forground as one portion is too white and distracting and much of is out of focus needlessly.</td>', 'great idea! I would have cropped more of the forground as one portion is too white and distracting and much of is out of focus needlessly.', '2003-04-15 18:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(267883, 17844, 7711, '<td valign="top">I love the transparency/shadow of the petals. very delicate.</td>', 'I love the transparency/shadow of the petals. very delicate.', '2003-04-15 18:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(267884, 17861, 7291, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Almost as if every square represents a different shade of blue. - 8</td>', 'Nice.  Almost as if every square represents a different shade of blue. - 8', '2003-04-15 18:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(267885, 18049, 7711, '<td valign="top">I like the landscape in this picture, though I''d almost prefer it if you were further back and captured more of it while making the woman a little further away.. might have worked as a silhouette as well.</td>', 'I like the landscape in this picture, though I''d almost prefer it if you were further back and captured more of it while making the woman a little further away.. might have worked as a silhouette as well.', '2003-04-15 18:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(267889, 18219, 7291, '<td valign="top">NICE SHOT!!!  The blurred leaves up front add a lot to the feel of the shot.  Almost as if you''re hiding.  I feel the picture still lacks some sharpne to be considered "perfect" but it''s about as close as you can get. - 9</td>', 'NICE SHOT!!!  The blurred leaves up front add a lot to the feel of the shot.  Almost as if you''re hiding.  I feel the picture still lacks some sharpne to be considered "perfect" but it''s about as close as you can get. - 9', '2003-04-15 18:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(267890, 17625, 7711, '<td valign="top">my top pick for the week! This is an awe-inspiring picture. The three portions of the picture from delicate hues to more dramatic orange really make this picture great! 10</td>', 'my top pick for the week! This is an awe-inspiring picture. The three portions of the picture from delicate hues to more dramatic orange really make this picture great! 10', '2003-04-15 18:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(267891, 17863, 7711, '<td valign="top">love the reflection in the drops, very crisp.</td>', 'love the reflection in the drops, very crisp.', '2003-04-15 18:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(267893, 18059, 7711, '<td valign="top">I would have taken the tones down a little to get more of the texture of the rust..good interpretation of the challenge though!</td>', 'I would have taken the tones down a little to get more of the texture of the rust..good interpretation of the challenge though!', '2003-04-15 18:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(267894, 17660, 7291, '<td valign="top">Good color variation.</td>', 'Good color variation.', '2003-04-15 18:47:07.000000', NULL, 1);
