(267895, 18148, 7291, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t quite seem to really capture the frost.  I would''ve missed it if not for the tite.  Very good use of Depth of Field though.</td>', 'Doesn''t quite seem to really capture the frost.  I would''ve missed it if not for the tite.  Very good use of Depth of Field though.', '2003-04-15 18:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
