(267903, 18122, 7291, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp focus.  But I think it''s up too cose to really get the wind effect.  Still, I see this near the top of list come next week.</td>', 'Nice sharp focus.  But I think it''s up too cose to really get the wind effect.  Still, I see this near the top of list come next week.', '2003-04-15 18:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
