(267924, 17625, 7291, '<td valign="top">Maybe my original comment didn''t take.  In any event, this is one of the most amazing photos I''ve seen.  Leaves me breathless.  Some people can go their entire lived never seeing something like this and you''ve captured it flawlessly.  Incredible work!!!</td>', 'Maybe my original comment didn''t take.  In any event, this is one of the most amazing photos I''ve seen.  Leaves me breathless.  Some people can go their entire lived never seeing something like this and you''ve captured it flawlessly.  Incredible work!!!', '2003-04-15 19:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
