(267980, 18191, 7010, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this photo. It''s very well balanced, it has a clear focus and the colors are beautiful and truthfull. The challenge is well met. Only a pity that you ''blew up your cover''. I hope that the shot won''t loose any points because of it.</td>', 'I like the composition of this photo. It''s very well balanced, it has a clear focus and the colors are beautiful and truthfull. The challenge is well met. Only a pity that you ''blew up your cover''. I hope that the shot won''t loose any points because of it.', '2003-04-15 20:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(267986, 17981, 7010, '<td valign="top">I like the suggestion you try to create here (if I''m not mistaking, off course. Should that be the case, all of the below is nonsense ;o). Unfortunately, it looses lots of it\''s power because of the reflection of the water drops, wich show that the kid is looking in a mirror, instead of thru a window. But I\''ve got to thank you. I would have made the same mistake I think ;o) Greetings</td>', 'I like the suggestion you try to create here (if I''m not mistaking, off course. Should that be the case, all of the below is nonsense ;o). Unfortunately, it looses lots of it\''s power because of the reflection of the water drops, wich show that the kid is looking in a mirror, instead of thru a window. But I\''ve got to thank you. I would have made the same mistake I think ;o) Greetings', '2003-04-15 21:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(267988, 18010, 7010, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Pity of the biciycle stuff in front, works a bit distracting.....</td>', 'Great shot! Pity of the biciycle stuff in front, works a bit distracting.....', '2003-04-15 21:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
