(268086, 18225, 3946, '<td valign="top">Very pretty shot here.  I really like the angle that you chose to shoot this.   Lots to see here...how the rock lines up with the tree and tree angles up to the sky and out of the picture.  Well focused and shows depth.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Very pretty shot here.  I really like the angle that you chose to shoot this.   Lots to see here...how the rock lines up with the tree and tree angles up to the sky and out of the picture.  Well focused and shows depth.  Nicely done!', '2003-04-15 22:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(268087, 18150, 6771, '<td valign="top">Nice use of negative space.  Is the sun rising/setting behind you.  The white poles have a purple cast, oh so does the clouds too.  Never mind.  how would a shot lying on the ground change the perspective?  Make the size of the first more dramatic and the others fade away smaller?  Nice shot</td>', 'Nice use of negative space.  Is the sun rising/setting behind you.  The white poles have a purple cast, oh so does the clouds too.  Never mind.  how would a shot lying on the ground change the perspective?  Make the size of the first more dramatic and the others fade away smaller?  Nice shot', '2003-04-15 22:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(268088, 17957, 6771, '<td valign="top">Crunch!  Nice use of lighting and exposure.  I think a more dramatic angle would have worked better.  little farther away with the footbridge coming in one side and the building in the topleft third?  Nice job</td>', 'Crunch!  Nice use of lighting and exposure.  I think a more dramatic angle would have worked better.  little farther away with the footbridge coming in one side and the building in the topleft third?  Nice job', '2003-04-15 22:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(268090, 18018, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great colors and use of negative space .  Little tighter focus, maybe around the tree, even though the subject is weather</td>', 'Great colors and use of negative space .  Little tighter focus, maybe around the tree, even though the subject is weather', '2003-04-15 22:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(268092, 17642, 6771, '<td valign="top">Good reflection separation.  the left side has something in the way that is distracting.   Maybe a closer shot down near the leaves and trying to catch one of the raindrop ripples in focus would have more impact</td>', 'Good reflection separation.  the left side has something in the way that is distracting.   Maybe a closer shot down near the leaves and trying to catch one of the raindrop ripples in focus would have more impact', '2003-04-15 22:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(268093, 18053, 3946, '<td valign="top">This has a real spooky feeling to it.  Seems like it should advertise some sort of horror movie.  I''m not a real fan of color distortion, but this gives it emotion with the backlit windmill and tree.  There is a lot of artifact, though, that distracts some.</td>', 'This has a real spooky feeling to it.  Seems like it should advertise some sort of horror movie.  I''m not a real fan of color distortion, but this gives it emotion with the backlit windmill and tree.  There is a lot of artifact, though, that distracts some.', '2003-04-15 22:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(268096, 18269, 6771, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting and color.  Love seeing these scenes.  The clouds have some great "pictures" of their own there.  Nice use of negative space and leaving the mountains.  Where is this shot at?  The mountains here in CO always give these dramatic clouds.  From the suns position, I would say this is shot to the west.  Maybe CO frontrange?  (C:</td>', 'Lovely lighting and color.  Love seeing these scenes.  The clouds have some great "pictures" of their own there.  Nice use of negative space and leaving the mountains.  Where is this shot at?  The mountains here in CO always give these dramatic clouds.  From the suns position, I would say this is shot to the west.  Maybe CO frontrange?  (C:', '2003-04-15 22:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(268097, 18161, 3946, '<td valign="top">Hey!  This is a great shot of the squirrel.  This would be so much better in the animal challenge.  Although the title says there''s heat, I don''t really think this applies to the weather challenge.  He''s so cute!!  You would definately of won the animal challenge with this</td>', 'Hey!  This is a great shot of the squirrel.  This would be so much better in the animal challenge.  Although the title says there''s heat, I don''t really think this applies to the weather challenge.  He''s so cute!!  You would definately of won the animal challenge with this', '2003-04-15 22:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(268098, 18257, 6771, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic colors and shadows.  Almost looks painted.  This will be a perfect shot with some dodging and burning.  Great job.  Not much more to say</td>', 'Very dramatic colors and shadows.  Almost looks painted.  This will be a perfect shot with some dodging and burning.  Great job.  Not much more to say', '2003-04-15 22:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
