(268102, 18158, 7838, '<td valign="top">i wonder what would have happened if you would have moved around a bit and got a better background. the brown makes it hard to see.  where is there ice in April. you must be in the mountainous region.</td>', 'i wonder what would have happened if you would have moved around a bit and got a better background. the brown makes it hard to see.  where is there ice in April. you must be in the mountainous region.', '2003-04-15 22:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
