(268107, 18042, 6771, '<td valign="top">Hey, looks like my place a few weeks ago in the Northern Frontrange.  Nice shot on snow, but their is more "grey" snow on the mailbox, but it migh be a shadow causing that.  A touch tighter focus</td>', 'Hey, looks like my place a few weeks ago in the Northern Frontrange.  Nice shot on snow, but their is more "grey" snow on the mailbox, but it migh be a shadow causing that.  A touch tighter focus', '2003-04-15 22:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
