(268257, 18182, 7151, '<td valign="top">Maybe coulda been better with better lighting.  Also, with so much of the water and rocks, weather isn''t really a focus.</td>', 'Maybe coulda been better with better lighting.  Also, with so much of the water and rocks, weather isn''t really a focus.', '2003-04-16 01:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(268259, 18260, 7151, '<td valign="top">Not so much weather, or the effects of weather... maybe the dreams of better weather coming?  Close, but...  It''s a little busy - none of the items really stand out, they all kind of blend together.</td>', 'Not so much weather, or the effects of weather... maybe the dreams of better weather coming?  Close, but...  It''s a little busy - none of the items really stand out, they all kind of blend together.', '2003-04-16 01:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(268261, 17921, 7613, '<td valign="top">This shot look great, I would have liked a small water craft in the sunlit area, that would have made the shot perfect, but good job regardless!!!</td>', 'This shot look great, I would have liked a small water craft in the sunlit area, that would have made the shot perfect, but good job regardless!!!', '2003-04-16 01:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(268262, 17625, 7613, '<td valign="top">Right shot, right lighting, right timing...it looks like it all came together for you here!!<br/>Brilliant shot!</td>', 'Right shot, right lighting, right timing...it looks like it all came together for you here!!Brilliant shot!', '2003-04-16 01:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(268263, 18120, 7151, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  (Desperate for "weather" in southern CA, I considered this one as well.)  The penny and title give it a unique twist.  Something about the overall image doesn''t quite apeal to me, yet it''s a fairly well done shot.  I want to say there''s too much clutter, but it fits the title.  Or maybe it doesn''t.  I can''t decide, but overall I think you did good.</td>', 'Good idea.  (Desperate for "weather" in southern CA, I considered this one as well.)  The penny and title give it a unique twist.  Something about the overall image doesn''t quite apeal to me, yet it''s a fairly well done shot.  I want to say there''s too much clutter, but it fits the title.  Or maybe it doesn''t.  I can''t decide, but overall I think you did good.', '2003-04-16 01:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(268264, 17762, 7151, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Excelent subject for the theme (lucky you, you''ve got weather! ;-) ).  Not sure how everyone else will feel, but I like the composition.  Also, the color, lighting, everything works in this shot.  This is a top shot in the challenge for me.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Excelent subject for the theme (lucky you, you''ve got weather! ;-) ).  Not sure how everyone else will feel, but I like the composition.  Also, the color, lighting, everything works in this shot.  This is a top shot in the challenge for me.', '2003-04-16 02:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(268265, 17658, 7151, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I like the lighting, and the hint of rain falling in the background.  Well don.</td>', 'Nice.  I like the lighting, and the hint of rain falling in the background.  Well don.', '2003-04-16 02:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(268266, 18204, 7151, '<td valign="top">The title says it all...  Too bad there''s nothing interesting to look at.</td>', 'The title says it all...  Too bad there''s nothing interesting to look at.', '2003-04-16 02:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(268267, 18187, 7151, '<td valign="top">Interesting clouds.  I wanna like this, but the lighting is just too weird.</td>', 'Interesting clouds.  I wanna like this, but the lighting is just too weird.', '2003-04-16 02:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(268268, 17902, 7151, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but for me, I think you should have let the clouds be in focus, and include a little more of the weather vane.  Not bad thoug.</td>', 'Good idea, but for me, I think you should have let the clouds be in focus, and include a little more of the weather vane.  Not bad thoug.', '2003-04-16 02:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(268270, 18271, 7151, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color.  Just can''t decide if you might have come up with a better way to cut out of the massive amounts of darkness at the top and bottom.  I guess that tells an important part of the story.</td>', 'Beautiful color.  Just can''t decide if you might have come up with a better way to cut out of the massive amounts of darkness at the top and bottom.  I guess that tells an important part of the story.', '2003-04-16 02:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(268272, 17947, 7151, '<td valign="top">This is so very small.  But it doesn''t look like a gloomy day to me.  The shadows seem to indicate bright sunlight, which isn''t my idea of gloomy.</td>', 'This is so very small.  But it doesn''t look like a gloomy day to me.  The shadows seem to indicate bright sunlight, which isn''t my idea of gloomy.', '2003-04-16 02:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(268273, 18054, 7151, '<td valign="top">A fun shot.  A little tighter crop might have helped keep the focus on the dog, as it is just a bit too much muddy water.</td>', 'A fun shot.  A little tighter crop might have helped keep the focus on the dog, as it is just a bit too much muddy water.', '2003-04-16 02:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(268276, 17850, 7151, '<td valign="top">A little too dark.  Brighter sunlight would have fit the title a littel better.  Nice idea though, pretty good focus and composition.</td>', 'A little too dark.  Brighter sunlight would have fit the title a littel better.  Nice idea though, pretty good focus and composition.', '2003-04-16 02:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(268280, 18003, 7151, '<td valign="top">Tighter on the water dripping from the spout would have fit with the title a little better.  And either a faster (freezing the drops) or slower (giving them a stronger sense of motion) sutter speed might have given a better effect to the drops.</td>', 'Tighter on the water dripping from the spout would have fit with the title a little better.  And either a faster (freezing the drops) or slower (giving them a stronger sense of motion) sutter speed might have given a better effect to the drops.', '2003-04-16 02:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(268281, 17861, 7151, '<td valign="top">At least you gave something more to look at than "Blue Skys"!  Pretty interesting idea overall, though the window''s a little dirty ;-), and it would have been a little better if the barrel difflection wasn''t so strong.</td>', 'At least you gave something more to look at than "Blue Skys"!  Pretty interesting idea overall, though the window''s a little dirty ;-), and it would have been a little better if the barrel difflection wasn''t so strong.', '2003-04-16 02:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(268282, 18100, 6893, '<td valign="top">I applaud your great good fortune. 8</td>', 'I applaud your great good fortune. 8', '2003-04-16 02:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(268284, 17660, 7151, '<td valign="top">Did you throw that snow on those poor flowers? ;-)</td>', 'Did you throw that snow on those poor flowers? ;-)', '2003-04-16 02:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(268286, 17703, 6893, '<td valign="top">I do believe this is the best I''ve seen.  The crisp detail conotes the crispnes of the surrounding air.</td>', 'I do believe this is the best I''ve seen.  The crisp detail conotes the crispnes of the surrounding air.', '2003-04-16 02:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(268288, 18094, 7151, '<td valign="top">Where in the world is it summer right now?  Spring in the north, fall in the south...  OK sunset shot, but it''s pretty dirty (spots) and noisy.</td>', 'Where in the world is it summer right now?  Spring in the north, fall in the south...  OK sunset shot, but it''s pretty dirty (spots) and noisy.', '2003-04-16 02:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(268291, 17864, 7151, '<td valign="top">What''s the title mean???  Nice shot, though a little crooked, and a little less water might have helped put the focus more on the weather.</td>', 'What''s the title mean???  Nice shot, though a little crooked, and a little less water might have helped put the focus more on the weather.', '2003-04-16 02:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(268294, 18049, 7151, '<td valign="top">It took about 10 seconds before it hit me how well you captured the theme with this shot.  There''s something odd with the horizon, rise of the hills to the left, and the clouds that gives it a sort of fisheyed feel that I''m not sure I like, but overall this is well done.</td>', 'It took about 10 seconds before it hit me how well you captured the theme with this shot.  There''s something odd with the horizon, rise of the hills to the left, and the clouds that gives it a sort of fisheyed feel that I''m not sure I like, but overall this is well done.', '2003-04-16 02:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
