(268420, 18004, 5628, '<td valign="top">Although this clearly shows the effects of weather, I think you are going to have a hard time with this shot. It is a little dark. Increasing the brightness might have helped a little, but probably would have made it look washed out.</td>', 'Although this clearly shows the effects of weather, I think you are going to have a hard time with this shot. It is a little dark. Increasing the brightness might have helped a little, but probably would have made it look washed out.', '2003-04-16 08:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(268422, 18151, 5628, '<td valign="top">I think you have a little too much contrast here. Cropping out the trees in the bottom would''ve made it a lot less apparent.</td>', 'I think you have a little too much contrast here. Cropping out the trees in the bottom would''ve made it a lot less apparent.', '2003-04-16 08:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(268425, 17821, 5728, '<td valign="top">This image doesn''t really tell me too much about the weather except maybe that it is a sunny day. Nice leaves though :-)</td>', 'This image doesn''t really tell me too much about the weather except maybe that it is a sunny day. Nice leaves though :-)', '2003-04-16 08:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(268428, 17674, 3290, '<td valign="top">Took me a second to figure it out. The angel is a little dark, probably cos the camera compensated for the brightness of the snow. I like its hat :-)</td>', 'Took me a second to figure it out. The angel is a little dark, probably cos the camera compensated for the brightness of the snow. I like its hat :-)', '2003-04-16 09:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(268429, 18010, 6922, '<td valign="top">Good to know someone post pic from Malaysia (am I right?). Good luck!</td>', 'Good to know someone post pic from Malaysia (am I right?). Good luck!', '2003-04-16 09:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(268431, 18076, 3290, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but slightly tilted to the right? The not-vertical chimney is a distraction. Nice tones in the sky, though.</td>', 'Pretty, but slightly tilted to the right? The not-vertical chimney is a distraction. Nice tones in the sky, though.', '2003-04-16 09:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(268432, 18233, 3290, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but the fountain is too dark - it looks like a dark, dirty smudge (not trying to be rude). Perhaps a stop more exposure? Colours in the sky are lovely.</td>', 'Pretty, but the fountain is too dark - it looks like a dark, dirty smudge (not trying to be rude). Perhaps a stop more exposure? Colours in the sky are lovely.', '2003-04-16 09:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(268434, 18117, 3290, '<td valign="top">Pretty. Well seen and captured.</td>', 'Pretty. Well seen and captured.', '2003-04-16 09:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(268435, 17844, 5728, '<td valign="top">Lovely detail and decent effect using the shallow DOF.</td>', 'Lovely detail and decent effect using the shallow DOF.', '2003-04-16 09:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(268436, 18036, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good colours in the stone on the tower. Pretty.</td>', 'Good colours in the stone on the tower. Pretty.', '2003-04-16 09:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(268437, 18183, 5728, '<td valign="top">You''re right, it''s postcard stuff, choice shot. And of course, lots of weather here :-)</td>', 'You''re right, it''s postcard stuff, choice shot. And of course, lots of weather here :-)', '2003-04-16 09:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(268438, 17721, 3290, '<td valign="top">A good shot slightly spoiled by the background. If you had moved the pot to a stretch of unmarked snow, the dark areas in the upper right wouldn''t be a distraction. I like the perspective.</td>', 'A good shot slightly spoiled by the background. If you had moved the pot to a stretch of unmarked snow, the dark areas in the upper right wouldn''t be a distraction. I like the perspective.', '2003-04-16 09:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(268439, 17884, 5728, '<td valign="top">Not only are you meeting the challenge showing miserable weather here, you''ve also taken a cool image with a wonderful composition. Well done.</td>', 'Not only are you meeting the challenge showing miserable weather here, you''ve also taken a cool image with a wonderful composition. Well done.', '2003-04-16 09:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(268440, 18242, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice. Shame about that bit of land in the top left which spils the effect a bit. For a print, I''d clone that out.</td>', 'Nice. Shame about that bit of land in the top left which spils the effect a bit. For a print, I''d clone that out.', '2003-04-16 09:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(268441, 17924, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good title! Them clouds are angry, I hope you got home on time :-) Good composition.</td>', 'Good title! Them clouds are angry, I hope you got home on time :-) Good composition.', '2003-04-16 09:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(268442, 17707, 3290, '<td valign="top">Like the ''warp'' effect.</td>', 'Like the ''warp'' effect.', '2003-04-16 09:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(268443, 17956, 5728, '<td valign="top">Cool contrast, clear blue summer skies at the top and wild angry storm clouds below. Good capture!</td>', 'Cool contrast, clear blue summer skies at the top and wild angry storm clouds below. Good capture!', '2003-04-16 09:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(268444, 18252, 3290, '<td valign="top">Crop is too tight in the corners (especially upper right). Otherwise good.</td>', 'Crop is too tight in the corners (especially upper right). Otherwise good.', '2003-04-16 09:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(268445, 18034, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.</td>', 'Nice perspective.', '2003-04-16 09:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(268446, 18256, 3290, '<td valign="top">Cool. I''d like to see the rest of the truck, but this conveys the feeling of being on a reain-drenched busy road well.</td>', 'Cool. I''d like to see the rest of the truck, but this conveys the feeling of being on a reain-drenched busy road well.', '2003-04-16 09:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(268447, 18060, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice whispy kind of cloud there, and an awesome crispy blue sky. Good shot despite the graininess.</td>', 'Nice whispy kind of cloud there, and an awesome crispy blue sky. Good shot despite the graininess.', '2003-04-16 09:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(268448, 17883, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is good, I only wish you had cropped the powerlines on the left out of the image.</td>', 'This is good, I only wish you had cropped the powerlines on the left out of the image.', '2003-04-16 09:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(268449, 18147, 3290, '<td valign="top">Horizon is tilted down to the left. Sky is good. land looks a bit lost.</td>', 'Horizon is tilted down to the left. Sky is good. land looks a bit lost.', '2003-04-16 09:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(268450, 18049, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very good representation of wind, clever!</td>', 'Very good representation of wind, clever!', '2003-04-16 09:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(268451, 18275, 3290, '<td valign="top">Cool cloud.</td>', 'Cool cloud.', '2003-04-16 09:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(268452, 18132, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now this is an original idea! Clever, well done.</td>', 'Now this is an original idea! Clever, well done.', '2003-04-16 09:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(268453, 18087, 3290, '<td valign="top">Your subject is somewhat lost against its background.</td>', 'Your subject is somewhat lost against its background.', '2003-04-16 09:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(268454, 17689, 5728, '<td valign="top">Choice composition, I love the way you''ve cropped it! Very in focus too, well done.</td>', 'Choice composition, I love the way you''ve cropped it! Very in focus too, well done.', '2003-04-16 09:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(268455, 17990, 3290, '<td valign="top">I like the grain and the graduations of colour.</td>', 'I like the grain and the graduations of colour.', '2003-04-16 09:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(268456, 18141, 3290, '<td valign="top">Pretty waterfall scene. Nicely shot.</td>', 'Pretty waterfall scene. Nicely shot.', '2003-04-16 09:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(268457, 18122, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice close-up study. Perhaps would improve if a little brighter (but perhaps not). Good use of DOF.</td>', 'Nice close-up study. Perhaps would improve if a little brighter (but perhaps not). Good use of DOF.', '2003-04-16 09:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(268458, 17669, 3290, '<td valign="top">That''s the first boat I''ve ever seen with a tree growing in it.</td>', 'That''s the first boat I''ve ever seen with a tree growing in it.', '2003-04-16 09:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(268459, 17623, 5728, '<td valign="top">The focus is bang on here, those water drops look amazing, choice!</td>', 'The focus is bang on here, those water drops look amazing, choice!', '2003-04-16 09:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(268460, 17921, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice effect. Well exposed.</td>', 'Nice effect. Well exposed.', '2003-04-16 09:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(268461, 17846, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent exposure, that IS bad weather! The only disturbing part is the horizon is crooked.</td>', 'Excellent exposure, that IS bad weather! The only disturbing part is the horizon is crooked.', '2003-04-16 09:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(268462, 18252, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea, and well composed! B&amp;W works here, would love to see the color version too though.</td>', 'Good idea, and well composed! B&W works here, would love to see the color version too though.', '2003-04-16 09:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(268464, 17946, 5728, '<td valign="top">brrr! I can''t believe it is still winter somewhere in the world! But don''t worry spring is on its way to you too. Nice pic, the way you have the branches and ice flowing through the image in ripples is very effective.</td>', 'brrr! I can''t believe it is still winter somewhere in the world! But don''t worry spring is on its way to you too. Nice pic, the way you have the branches and ice flowing through the image in ripples is very effective.', '2003-04-16 09:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(268466, 18147, 5728, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured a very crisp and deep blue in this one. The contrast of the white clouds against the blue is amazing. Did you use a polarizer filter? I like this!</td>', 'You''ve captured a very crisp and deep blue in this one. The contrast of the white clouds against the blue is amazing. Did you use a polarizer filter? I like this!', '2003-04-16 09:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(268467, 17955, 5728, '<td valign="top">This pic tells me a story of how spring is killing off the winter, well done. You have composed this image fantastically!</td>', 'This pic tells me a story of how spring is killing off the winter, well done. You have composed this image fantastically!', '2003-04-16 09:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(268469, 17891, 5728, '<td valign="top">Ahh Iceland! Excellent exposure, you got the shutter speed pefect here, the stariness of those lights is amazing! It doesn''t tell me too much about the weather though, only that it is very calm and not raining, but I guess that''s weather too, right :-)</td>', 'Ahh Iceland! Excellent exposure, you got the shutter speed pefect here, the stariness of those lights is amazing! It doesn''t tell me too much about the weather though, only that it is very calm and not raining, but I guess that''s weather too, right :-)', '2003-04-16 09:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(268471, 18007, 5728, '<td valign="top">Great detail! Those raindrops look awesome, good job!</td>', 'Great detail! Those raindrops look awesome, good job!', '2003-04-16 09:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(268472, 17628, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow stormy skies, nice capture! The whole image is a little grainy but it seems to work here.</td>', 'Wow stormy skies, nice capture! The whole image is a little grainy but it seems to work here.', '2003-04-16 09:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(268473, 17762, 5728, '<td valign="top">I would have prefered to see this without a border or at least with a border of neutral color. The composition is good with the trees flowing into the image. The contrast of silohuetted trees against a crisp blue sky is very effective.</td>', 'I would have prefered to see this without a border or at least with a border of neutral color. The composition is good with the trees flowing into the image. The contrast of silohuetted trees against a crisp blue sky is very effective.', '2003-04-16 09:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(268474, 18114, 5728, '<td valign="top">Awesome texture! This would have been even better if the bottom left and top right corner had been full in focus as well. Good idea though and of course it meets the challenge.</td>', 'Awesome texture! This would have been even better if the bottom left and top right corner had been full in focus as well. Good idea though and of course it meets the challenge.', '2003-04-16 09:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(268475, 18161, 5728, '<td valign="top">This shot would have done very well in the fauna challenge!! Even a ribbon winner for sure, but that''s life huh? Anyway it is an excellent image, well cropped and the shallow DOF does wonders for it.</td>', 'This shot would have done very well in the fauna challenge!! Even a ribbon winner for sure, but that''s life huh? Anyway it is an excellent image, well cropped and the shallow DOF does wonders for it.', '2003-04-16 09:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(268476, 18191, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good depiction of wind. The crop is also very good, better than trying to fit the whole flag into the image.</td>', 'Good depiction of wind. The crop is also very good, better than trying to fit the whole flag into the image.', '2003-04-16 09:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(268477, 18242, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a postcard photo, well done!</td>', 'This is a postcard photo, well done!', '2003-04-16 09:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(268478, 18259, 5728, '<td valign="top">This looks very good. You have a good imagination, clever and original. Well done.</td>', 'This looks very good. You have a good imagination, clever and original. Well done.', '2003-04-16 09:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(268479, 18139, 5728, '<td valign="top">The way you have framed the blue clear sky with angry stormy clouds makes this a top photo. Looks like an eye. Maybe "Eye of the Storm" could also have been a good title.</td>', 'The way you have framed the blue clear sky with angry stormy clouds makes this a top photo. Looks like an eye. Maybe "Eye of the Storm" could also have been a good title.', '2003-04-16 09:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(268481, 17669, 5728, '<td valign="top">Yep that boat is weathered! Nice find, and well shot. Desaturating all the colors except the reds wasn''t really necessary, but it works here as well.</td>', 'Yep that boat is weathered! Nice find, and well shot. Desaturating all the colors except the reds wasn''t really necessary, but it works here as well.', '2003-04-16 09:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(268483, 18058, 5728, '<td valign="top">Great DOF and that raindrop! Wow! The detail is choice.</td>', 'Great DOF and that raindrop! Wow! The detail is choice.', '2003-04-16 09:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(268494, 18223, 342, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and compostion of this photo</td>', 'I like the colors and compostion of this photo', '2003-04-16 10:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(268495, 17883, 342, '<td valign="top">It really is hard to see wind in a photo, but I will give you the benefit of the doubt.</td>', 'It really is hard to see wind in a photo, but I will give you the benefit of the doubt.', '2003-04-16 10:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(268498, 17903, 5728, '<td valign="top">Crispy blue skies you have there. The building in the foreground is a little too dark in comparison to the skies. Interesting composition.</td>', 'Crispy blue skies you have there. The building in the foreground is a little too dark in comparison to the skies. Interesting composition.', '2003-04-16 10:26:30.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(268500, 17901, 5728, '<td valign="top">He he funny! Nice simple image, composition is good. The silohuettes of the trees against a crisp blue sky is effective.</td>', 'He he funny! Nice simple image, composition is good. The silohuettes of the trees against a crisp blue sky is effective.', '2003-04-16 10:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(268501, 18276, 342, '<td valign="top">i think i would have liked this better had you left the color</td>', 'i think i would have liked this better had you left the color', '2003-04-16 10:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(268502, 17709, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good weather shot, those clouds look very stormy up there. I like the contrast of the angry clouds against the red ones at the bottom. The border is a tad to thick for this image.</td>', 'Good weather shot, those clouds look very stormy up there. I like the contrast of the angry clouds against the red ones at the bottom. The border is a tad to thick for this image.', '2003-04-16 10:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(268503, 18010, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is the hardest rain I have seen in this challenge, good capture!</td>', 'This is the hardest rain I have seen in this challenge, good capture!', '2003-04-16 10:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(268504, 18132, 342, '<td valign="top">i dont rhink a snow globe counts, anyway, this picture seems to be on a slight slant</td>', 'i dont rhink a snow globe counts, anyway, this picture seems to be on a slight slant', '2003-04-16 10:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(268505, 18003, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a simple shot, but tells a whole story.</td>', 'This is a simple shot, but tells a whole story.', '2003-04-16 10:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(268506, 17950, 5728, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the weather report, but I can see it! Very stormy front, good capture.</td>', 'Thanks for the weather report, but I can see it! Very stormy front, good capture.', '2003-04-16 10:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(268507, 17798, 342, '<td valign="top">pic seems to be on a slight slantwhich would make all the water flow down hill and presumably to the south pole</td>', 'pic seems to be on a slight slantwhich would make all the water flow down hill and presumably to the south pole', '2003-04-16 10:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(268508, 17952, 5728, '<td valign="top">They sure don''t look like storm clouds! My guess is that it stayed fine all day right? You captured the wind in this image by the look of those flags fluttering there though, well done.</td>', 'They sure don''t look like storm clouds! My guess is that it stayed fine all day right? You captured the wind in this image by the look of those flags fluttering there though, well done.', '2003-04-16 10:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(268509, 17853, 5728, '<td valign="top">Ah I see, only the tips of the trees are iced, clever! Very blue sky. The powerlines are a little disturbing though.</td>', 'Ah I see, only the tips of the trees are iced, clever! Very blue sky. The powerlines are a little disturbing though.', '2003-04-16 10:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(268510, 18201, 342, '<td valign="top">i do not think what happened in iraq is a result of weather,  but i could be wrong?  otherwise nice picture what did the color version look like,  i was wondering why you chose to create this photo in bandw</td>', 'i do not think what happened in iraq is a result of weather,  but i could be wrong?  otherwise nice picture what did the color version look like,  i was wondering why you chose to create this photo in bandw', '2003-04-16 10:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(268511, 18260, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is original, good idea. And very summerly composed :-)</td>', 'This is original, good idea. And very summerly composed :-)', '2003-04-16 10:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(268512, 17915, 342, '<td valign="top">looks like he will be waiting quite a while</td>', 'looks like he will be waiting quite a while', '2003-04-16 10:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(268513, 17601, 5728, '<td valign="top">This photo is very soft and dreamy, it almost has the impression of a painting. Good.</td>', 'This photo is very soft and dreamy, it almost has the impression of a painting. Good.', '2003-04-16 10:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(268514, 18265, 5728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful macro, vivid color and contrast there. The cropping is very good, but weather?</td>', 'Beautiful macro, vivid color and contrast there. The cropping is very good, but weather?', '2003-04-16 10:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(268515, 17861, 342, '<td valign="top">this would have been a nice photo in the squares competition</td>', 'this would have been a nice photo in the squares competition', '2003-04-16 10:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(268516, 18186, 5728, '<td valign="top">Clever idea to depict wind! Well done.</td>', 'Clever idea to depict wind! Well done.', '2003-04-16 10:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(268517, 18090, 342, '<td valign="top">this seems a little dark to me but good composition</td>', 'this seems a little dark to me but good composition', '2003-04-16 10:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(268518, 17923, 5728, '<td valign="top">That''s been standing there a few years! You haven''t only captured a weathered old loading ramp but you also managed to get some pretty awesome blue skies out the back too.</td>', 'That''s been standing there a few years! You haven''t only captured a weathered old loading ramp but you also managed to get some pretty awesome blue skies out the back too.', '2003-04-16 10:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(268519, 18256, 5728, '<td valign="top">Yuk! That is BAD weather. Good capture, this meets the challenge twice over!</td>', 'Yuk! That is BAD weather. Good capture, this meets the challenge twice over!', '2003-04-16 10:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(268520, 18246, 5728, '<td valign="top">Yuk those clouds look angry! Time to run home me thinks! Very good interpretation of weather, well done.</td>', 'Yuk those clouds look angry! Time to run home me thinks! Very good interpretation of weather, well done.', '2003-04-16 10:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(268528, 17907, 5728, '<td valign="top">Just love the contrast of red/pink on green here! Choice!</td>', 'Just love the contrast of red/pink on green here! Choice!', '2003-04-16 10:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(268529, 18276, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wonderful detail, those water drops have come out fantasically!!!</td>', 'Wonderful detail, those water drops have come out fantasically!!!', '2003-04-16 10:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(268530, 17960, 5728, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, a little grainy but good. I love all the different tones of blue you''ve brought out in this image.</td>', 'Cool shot, a little grainy but good. I love all the different tones of blue you''ve brought out in this image.', '2003-04-16 10:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(268531, 18269, 5728, '<td valign="top">Between storms is a good title! Those whispy white clouds give this image heaps of impact!</td>', 'Between storms is a good title! Those whispy white clouds give this image heaps of impact!', '2003-04-16 10:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(268532, 17851, 5728, '<td valign="top">Original, clever and well done!</td>', 'Original, clever and well done!', '2003-04-16 10:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(268533, 18219, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent shallow DOF! This shot would also be ideal for the fauna challenge!</td>', 'Excellent shallow DOF! This shot would also be ideal for the fauna challenge!', '2003-04-16 10:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(268535, 17892, 5728, '<td valign="top">Glaube ich nicht, aber wer weiss? Choice shot! The contrast of deep summery blue sky in the background with a big angry old rain cloud in the foreground is very effective. Good capture!</td>', 'Glaube ich nicht, aber wer weiss? Choice shot! The contrast of deep summery blue sky in the background with a big angry old rain cloud in the foreground is very effective. Good capture!', '2003-04-16 10:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(268536, 18248, 5728, '<td valign="top">Ah Alcatraz! That is an excellent sky there! The blues are amazing. The contrast between the summery blue sky and choppy cold water is great!</td>', 'Ah Alcatraz! That is an excellent sky there! The blues are amazing. The contrast between the summery blue sky and choppy cold water is great!', '2003-04-16 10:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(268537, 17880, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea, looks like good fishing weather. I would have placed the boat up a lot further following the rlule of thirds. I know it would have cut out the sky but maybe a lower shooting position would have taken care of it.</td>', 'Good idea, looks like good fishing weather. I would have placed the boat up a lot further following the rlule of thirds. I know it would have cut out the sky but maybe a lower shooting position would have taken care of it.', '2003-04-16 10:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(268544, 18228, 5728, '<td valign="top">This makes for an excellent texture. The water drops gathered in the fence wire just impact this image to pieces, choice shot!</td>', 'This makes for an excellent texture. The water drops gathered in the fence wire just impact this image to pieces, choice shot!', '2003-04-16 11:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(268546, 17605, 5728, '<td valign="top">You were lucky getting to go out yachting for this shot! You ended up with an awesome image depicting both strong wind and stormy skies (difficult to tell if the sky is blue of not in B&amp;W).</td>', 'You were lucky getting to go out yachting for this shot! You ended up with an awesome image depicting both strong wind and stormy skies (difficult to tell if the sky is blue of not in B&W).', '2003-04-16 11:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(268547, 17682, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wind does do that to sand doesn''t it! Good idea for a weather shot.</td>', 'Wind does do that to sand doesn''t it! Good idea for a weather shot.', '2003-04-16 11:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(268548, 17798, 5728, '<td valign="top">An excellent photo to depict weather! This pic tells me everything, good!</td>', 'An excellent photo to depict weather! This pic tells me everything, good!', '2003-04-16 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(268549, 18163, 5728, '<td valign="top">Spooky! That skyline looks so ghostly there, you do have a good eye. Well done.</td>', 'Spooky! That skyline looks so ghostly there, you do have a good eye. Well done.', '2003-04-16 11:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
