(268751, 17956, 7711, '<td valign="top">too bad the sun wasn''t co-operating with you and providing more light on the left, I would have loved more detail on those tempestous clouds. lovely tones nevertheless.</td>', 'too bad the sun wasn''t co-operating with you and providing more light on the left, I would have loved more detail on those tempestous clouds. lovely tones nevertheless.', '2003-04-16 18:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
