(268782, 18265, 7599, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo.. but where is the weather in it? Perhaps I''m being a little too literal, but I don''t believe it effectively meets the challenge. This could have been a studio shot, theres no way to tell if it was even taken outside (in weather) I''m willing to bet you would have got very high marks in the next challenge.</td>', 'This is a great photo.. but where is the weather in it? Perhaps I''m being a little too literal, but I don''t believe it effectively meets the challenge. This could have been a studio shot, theres no way to tell if it was even taken outside (in weather) I''m willing to bet you would have got very high marks in the next challenge.', '2003-04-16 19:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(268783, 17912, 7599, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo, unusual subject and I think you framed it perfectly. The fact that it''s raining/rained, and hence the playground would be deserted, is conveyed well in the B&amp;W choice. That''s the strong feeling I get from this photo. I do wonder if it did actually rain or if you added the water, the only reason I ask is the placement of the drops. That''s just a curiosity on my part.</td>', 'I really like this photo, unusual subject and I think you framed it perfectly. The fact that it''s raining/rained, and hence the playground would be deserted, is conveyed well in the B&W choice. That''s the strong feeling I get from this photo. I do wonder if it did actually rain or if you added the water, the only reason I ask is the placement of the drops. That''s just a curiosity on my part.', '2003-04-16 19:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(268784, 17747, 7599, '<td valign="top">Meets the "effects of weather" aspect of the challenge. The only thing I would have changed would have been the choice of sepia. I just don''t think it fits. Other then that, I think it''s a great job!</td>', 'Meets the "effects of weather" aspect of the challenge. The only thing I would have changed would have been the choice of sepia. I just don''t think it fits. Other then that, I think it''s a great job!', '2003-04-16 19:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(268788, 18158, 7599, '<td valign="top">Great composition, love the unique sizing, it works with the subject. The only thing I think that detracts are the overy white patches on the top (sun spots?) and the overly large brown border. I think it would have been far more effective if the border was a bit more subtle.</td>', 'Great composition, love the unique sizing, it works with the subject. The only thing I think that detracts are the overy white patches on the top (sun spots?) and the overly large brown border. I think it would have been far more effective if the border was a bit more subtle.', '2003-04-16 19:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(268790, 18160, 7599, '<td valign="top">Fantastic, in my personal top ten!</td>', 'Fantastic, in my personal top ten!', '2003-04-16 19:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
