(268848, 18133, 6999, '<td valign="top">Gosh, I don''t know about this shot at all. It looks like a snapshot, but then it''s too well composed for that. Like the contrast of the lines of the swing and slide with the broken tree, like the angle. Everything slightly ''wrong'' by the accepted ''rules'', but it works. i bet this is one of those shots that you really like and can''t quite work out why. Or maybe I''m under-estimating you.</td>', 'Gosh, I don''t know about this shot at all. It looks like a snapshot, but then it''s too well composed for that. Like the contrast of the lines of the swing and slide with the broken tree, like the angle. Everything slightly ''wrong'' by the accepted ''rules'', but it works. i bet this is one of those shots that you really like and can''t quite work out why. Or maybe I''m under-estimating you.', '2003-04-16 20:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(268850, 18227, 4380, '<td valign="top">nice one..a little to bright..but its okay..</td>', 'nice one..a little to bright..but its okay..', '2003-04-16 20:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
