(268856, 18252, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this, and I think the bw works well.  Being nitpicky, I think an unwrinkled umbrella wouldn''t look quite so "unused"</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this, and I think the bw works well.  Being nitpicky, I think an unwrinkled umbrella wouldn''t look quite so "unused"', '2003-04-16 20:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(268857, 18087, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good thought, and good shot - though if it were mine, I''d have tried to place it against a simpler background, or use a shallow DOF to blur out the other trees - all those other lines and tones distract from the impact.</td>', 'Good thought, and good shot - though if it were mine, I''d have tried to place it against a simpler background, or use a shallow DOF to blur out the other trees - all those other lines and tones distract from the impact.', '2003-04-16 20:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
