(268871, 17669, 811, '<td valign="top">Great use of a different interpretation.  This picture tells a story to me.  Also, the desaturated colors work well.</td>', 'Great use of a different interpretation.  This picture tells a story to me.  Also, the desaturated colors work well.', '2003-04-16 20:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(268872, 17623, 7711, '<td valign="top">lovely composition. I think the positioning/crop is just right, and you''ve certainly met the challenge!</td>', 'lovely composition. I think the positioning/crop is just right, and you''ve certainly met the challenge!', '2003-04-16 20:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(268873, 18269, 6999, '<td valign="top">Fabulous distance in this shot, a real sense of scale. Whilst the very low horizon really helps the sense of hight, I wonder if you haven''t perhaps excluded too much of the ground - as I look, I really want to see something more foreground-y. Minor point, though, but foreground elements can really ''place'' landscape shots.</td>', 'Fabulous distance in this shot, a real sense of scale. Whilst the very low horizon really helps the sense of hight, I wonder if you haven''t perhaps excluded too much of the ground - as I look, I really want to see something more foreground-y. Minor point, though, but foreground elements can really ''place'' landscape shots.', '2003-04-16 20:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(268874, 18007, 811, '<td valign="top">For some reason, I really like this shot.  I guess it is the simplicity and color.  I also like that it is on a more diagonal plane than straight horizontal or vertical</td>', 'For some reason, I really like this shot.  I guess it is the simplicity and color.  I also like that it is on a more diagonal plane than straight horizontal or vertical', '2003-04-16 20:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
