(268877, 17880, 7711, '<td valign="top">maybe a little more sky to emphasize the challenge them, but a very nice shot in any event. I like the tininess of the fishers, it adds a lot of character.<br/></td>', 'maybe a little more sky to emphasize the challenge them, but a very nice shot in any event. I like the tininess of the fishers, it adds a lot of character.', '2003-04-16 20:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
