(268882, 18016, 6999, '<td valign="top">Don''t really like the positioning of that bush - too central for me - I would have wanted to use it to frame the brightest portion of the sky and to be more strongly silhouetted - which might have allowed a shorter exposure to prevent the burn-out as well. Still a good image.</td>', 'Don''t really like the positioning of that bush - too central for me - I would have wanted to use it to frame the brightest portion of the sky and to be more strongly silhouetted - which might have allowed a shorter exposure to prevent the burn-out as well. Still a good image.', '2003-04-16 20:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(268883, 17848, 4380, '<td valign="top">excellent shot, a little grainy (i dont knw if its intentional)..i like the concept...still high mark from me. Im giving you 9. congrats and good luck.</td>', 'excellent shot, a little grainy (i dont knw if its intentional)..i like the concept...still high mark from me. Im giving you 9. congrats and good luck.', '2003-04-16 20:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
