(268994, 18181, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nice composition... and a beautiful sky!  Lighting on the palm tree works very well, in my opinion.</td>', 'Nice composition... and a beautiful sky!  Lighting on the palm tree works very well, in my opinion.', '2003-04-16 22:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(268995, 17953, 7033, '<td valign="top">Fantastic storm shot!  I love how the lightning has highlighted the clouds in the distance.  City lights take away from the overall effect, in my opinion, but not enough to cause serious problems with the shot.  --9</td>', 'Fantastic storm shot!  I love how the lightning has highlighted the clouds in the distance.  City lights take away from the overall effect, in my opinion, but not enough to cause serious problems with the shot.  --9', '2003-04-16 22:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(269003, 17855, 7033, '<td valign="top">Great perspective shot, and a good approach to the challenge.  My first thought was that the building should have been shot from the center, but then I realized that you would have lost the silhouette of that wonderful bare tree!  In my opinion, it adds a lot of interest to the shot, and creates a sort of ''grounding'' and sense of place.  Very well done!</td>', 'Great perspective shot, and a good approach to the challenge.  My first thought was that the building should have been shot from the center, but then I realized that you would have lost the silhouette of that wonderful bare tree!  In my opinion, it adds a lot of interest to the shot, and creates a sort of ''grounding'' and sense of place.  Very well done!', '2003-04-16 22:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(269017, 18233, 7033, '<td valign="top">Truly a beautiful sunset shot!  I''m not certain I like the fountain; in my opinion, it would be better with more lighting in/on it, and without the bit of flare near the fountain.  Of course, then you might draw attention from the sun itself.... hmmm.... Fantastic job!  --9</td>', 'Truly a beautiful sunset shot!  I''m not certain I like the fountain; in my opinion, it would be better with more lighting in/on it, and without the bit of flare near the fountain.  Of course, then you might draw attention from the sun itself.... hmmm.... Fantastic job!  --9', '2003-04-16 22:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
