(269199, 17666, 6523, '<td valign="top">Nice photo -- I think it might be a bit more effective, though, if you cropped out some of the black in the foreground so that the setting (rising?) sun had more focus.</td>', 'Nice photo -- I think it might be a bit more effective, though, if you cropped out some of the black in the foreground so that the setting (rising?) sun had more focus.', '2003-04-17 01:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
