(269645, 17864, 7711, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if I would have chosen bw for this picture because of what it does for the water and the mountains, but those are surely forboding clouds.</td>', 'I don''t know if I would have chosen bw for this picture because of what it does for the water and the mountains, but those are surely forboding clouds.', '2003-04-17 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
