(269650, 18265, 7711, '<td valign="top">lovely flower, but I think you might have missed the challenge theme?</td>', 'lovely flower, but I think you might have missed the challenge theme?', '2003-04-17 15:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(269655, 17816, 6450, '<td valign="top">this photo.......um what can i say, sucks, i just dont understand how someone could take a picture to look like this and expect them to win. i mean i see the wind blowing the tape around but the entire white half makes me think this picture is a fake . im really debating on weather or not to recommend this photo for disqualification. i only have one question for you this week my friend, what were you thinking when you hit the button to shoot this picture, come on honestly this is a waste of computer memory and my time.</td>', 'this photo.......um what can i say, sucks, i just dont understand how someone could take a picture to look like this and expect them to win. i mean i see the wind blowing the tape around but the entire white half makes me think this picture is a fake . im really debating on weather or not to recommend this photo for disqualification. i only have one question for you this week my friend, what were you thinking when you hit the button to shoot this picture, come on honestly this is a waste of computer memory and my time.', '2003-04-17 15:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(269671, 17981, 4517, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot. Bright, clean and sharp where it`s meant to be. 9</td>', 'I like this one a lot. Bright, clean and sharp where it`s meant to be. 9', '2003-04-17 15:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(269678, 18181, 7350, '<td valign="top">I bet a lot of people are going to vote you down for not having some more interesting weather---but not me.  This is my favorite kind of weather! 8.</td>', 'I bet a lot of people are going to vote you down for not having some more interesting weather---but not me.  This is my favorite kind of weather! 8.', '2003-04-17 16:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(269679, 18252, 7350, '<td valign="top">This is one of those people might vote down because it doesn''t actually show weather happening.  Not me!  This screams weather to me.  (Crummy weather, too!)  7</td>', 'This is one of those people might vote down because it doesn''t actually show weather happening.  Not me!  This screams weather to me.  (Crummy weather, too!)  7', '2003-04-17 16:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(269680, 17912, 7350, '<td valign="top">That is the most depressed piece of playground equipment I''ve ever seen.  Did it really rain that day, or did you just hose it down and shoot in black and white to not give away the sunny day?  Either way, the shot is great.  9 from me, for what it''s worth.</td>', 'That is the most depressed piece of playground equipment I''ve ever seen.  Did it really rain that day, or did you just hose it down and shoot in black and white to not give away the sunny day?  Either way, the shot is great.  9 from me, for what it''s worth.', '2003-04-17 16:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(269681, 18191, 7350, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, wind.  I see.  I like it, though the flagpole is a little too bright (I see a lot of "halo" in there).  I''ll give it a 7 for the great focus.</td>', 'Ahhh, wind.  I see.  I like it, though the flagpole is a little too bright (I see a lot of "halo" in there).  I''ll give it a 7 for the great focus.', '2003-04-17 16:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(269684, 17861, 7350, '<td valign="top">The window made this shot interesting enough to earn a 7.</td>', 'The window made this shot interesting enough to earn a 7.', '2003-04-17 16:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(269686, 17846, 7350, '<td valign="top">I don''t know where you live, but I''m never coming to visit!  Great shot.  7.</td>', 'I don''t know where you live, but I''m never coming to visit!  Great shot.  7.', '2003-04-17 16:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(269687, 18227, 7350, '<td valign="top">Holy smokes, the water droplet effect a million times!  7 from me.</td>', 'Holy smokes, the water droplet effect a million times!  7 from me.', '2003-04-17 16:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(269688, 18018, 7350, '<td valign="top">That happened on my wedding day--Blue skies, then dark clouds (and a downpour on our outdoor reception), then blue skies again.  I like the composition of this shot with the tree.  8.</td>', 'That happened on my wedding day--Blue skies, then dark clouds (and a downpour on our outdoor reception), then blue skies again.  I like the composition of this shot with the tree.  8.', '2003-04-17 16:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(269689, 17945, 7350, '<td valign="top">I swear I saw this tree and this cloud in another submission.  Hmmm.</td>', 'I swear I saw this tree and this cloud in another submission.  Hmmm.', '2003-04-17 16:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(269690, 17963, 7350, '<td valign="top">Is this real weather or did you just sprinkle this branch? 7.</td>', 'Is this real weather or did you just sprinkle this branch? 7.', '2003-04-17 16:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(269693, 17660, 7350, '<td valign="top">Real snow, or is this just ice from your ice crusher?  Either way, great shot.  I like the contrast of colors and ideas. 8.</td>', 'Real snow, or is this just ice from your ice crusher?  Either way, great shot.  I like the contrast of colors and ideas. 8.', '2003-04-17 16:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(269704, 17816, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m a bit confused by the image as a whole... was the white left side intentional?  I''m afraid I don''t quite understand the connection to the challenge with the portion of the image I can see...</td>', 'I''m a bit confused by the image as a whole... was the white left side intentional?  I''m afraid I don''t quite understand the connection to the challenge with the portion of the image I can see...', '2003-04-17 16:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(269705, 17658, 7350, '<td valign="top">Another one where I''m wondering if it was really raining, or if you staged this.  I love the purple, though.  Reminds me of a school railing, or something. 7.</td>', 'Another one where I''m wondering if it was really raining, or if you staged this.  I love the purple, though.  Reminds me of a school railing, or something. 7.', '2003-04-17 16:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
