(269712, 18152, 7350, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites of the week.  The reflection makes it.  I''ll give it a 10.</td>', 'One of my favorites of the week.  The reflection makes it.  I''ll give it a 10.', '2003-04-17 16:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(269714, 18100, 3102, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!  The rays of light are stunning!  If a little editing were allowed, it would be interesting to see this with a brighter landscape.  I realize that trying to brighten the image as a whole would lose much of the sunray effect, though.  - 9</td>', 'Wonderful!  The rays of light are stunning!  If a little editing were allowed, it would be interesting to see this with a brighter landscape.  I realize that trying to brighten the image as a whole would lose much of the sunray effect, though.  - 9', '2003-04-17 16:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(269715, 18009, 7350, '<td valign="top">Uh oh, Toto!  Looks like we''re not in Kansas anymore.  (Actually, this looks like we could very well be in Kansas!)  Only a 7 because it''s too dark on the front of the barn.</td>', 'Uh oh, Toto!  Looks like we''re not in Kansas anymore.  (Actually, this looks like we could very well be in Kansas!)  Only a 7 because it''s too dark on the front of the barn.', '2003-04-17 16:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
