(269733, 18092, 7350, '<td valign="top">I expected at least one of these.  Others are probably voting you low for not specifically showing weather, huh?  With the cute little girl (Wow--check out that hair!), I give it a 7.</td>', 'I expected at least one of these.  Others are probably voting you low for not specifically showing weather, huh?  With the cute little girl (Wow--check out that hair!), I give it a 7.', '2003-04-17 16:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
