(270062, 17625, 6405, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, maybe a bit too dark 9 from me!</td>', 'I like the photo, maybe a bit too dark 9 from me!', '2003-04-18 03:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(270063, 17646, 6405, '<td valign="top">Interesting landscape 8 here!</td>', 'Interesting landscape 8 here!', '2003-04-18 03:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(270064, 18226, 2586, '<td valign="top">It is a nice enough image but there''s something that bothers me about it that i cannot pinpoint exactly. I think it has to do with the fact that everything in the image represents warm colors/tones. Even the trees are a warm, brownish hue. If they had been black there would have been more contrast and a better balance between warm and cold colors. As it is, it gives me a bit of a sugary feeling when i look at it long enough. 7 Journey</td>', 'It is a nice enough image but there''s something that bothers me about it that i cannot pinpoint exactly. I think it has to do with the fact that everything in the image represents warm colors/tones. Even the trees are a warm, brownish hue. If they had been black there would have been more contrast and a better balance between warm and cold colors. As it is, it gives me a bit of a sugary feeling when i look at it long enough. 7 Journey', '2003-04-18 03:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(270065, 17719, 2586, '<td valign="top">Even though i am very patriotic, i find this image rather boring and unoriginal. It doesn''t even invoke any emotions in me. 5 Journey</td>', 'Even though i am very patriotic, i find this image rather boring and unoriginal. It doesn''t even invoke any emotions in me. 5 Journey', '2003-04-18 03:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(270067, 17852, 2586, '<td valign="top">Nice moody and lonely image. Very forlorn.  I like it. Because of the lack of contrast, it''s all rather flat but that was the aim, right? :)  Good composition. Nicely framed by the tree. 7 Journey</td>', 'Nice moody and lonely image. Very forlorn.  I like it. Because of the lack of contrast, it''s all rather flat but that was the aim, right? :)  Good composition. Nicely framed by the tree. 7 Journey', '2003-04-18 03:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(270068, 18112, 2586, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image. Lovely composition. I am strongly getting the impression though that it has been enhanced by something like Neatimage. If so, i would be less impressed because personally i find Neatimage (even though it''s fully legit) on a par with heavy Photoshop editing, that is not allowed.  8 Journey</td>', 'This is a beautiful image. Lovely composition. I am strongly getting the impression though that it has been enhanced by something like Neatimage. If so, i would be less impressed because personally i find Neatimage (even though it''s fully legit) on a par with heavy Photoshop editing, that is not allowed.  8 Journey', '2003-04-18 03:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(270069, 18250, 2586, '<td valign="top">This is certainly intriguing. Love the details of textures and the incredibly vivid splashes of colors that are accentuated all the more by the prevailing darkness. Would have cropped off more of the top, it is a little too dark and non-descript there. 8 Journey</td>', 'This is certainly intriguing. Love the details of textures and the incredibly vivid splashes of colors that are accentuated all the more by the prevailing darkness. Would have cropped off more of the top, it is a little too dark and non-descript there. 8 Journey', '2003-04-18 03:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
