(270074, 18213, 2586, '<td valign="top">Nice image. The shape of the ice reminds me of shark teeth :) Nice detail in the rocks and the movement of the water is lovely. 8 Journey</td>', 'Nice image. The shape of the ice reminds me of shark teeth :) Nice detail in the rocks and the movement of the water is lovely. 8 Journey', '2003-04-18 03:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(270075, 17848, 2586, '<td valign="top">Nice, nice image. Love the drama of it all. It reminds me of a famous photograph and for the world of it, i cannot come up with its name or photographer :(  8 Journey</td>', 'Nice, nice image. Love the drama of it all. It reminds me of a famous photograph and for the world of it, i cannot come up with its name or photographer :(  8 Journey', '2003-04-18 04:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(270076, 18233, 2586, '<td valign="top">The title says beautiful but this picture does not come across as such to me. Too much of a good thing is sometimes ugly. And in this picture there is way too much. As a result, the sky looks a little garish; that "sunburst" looks so Photoshoppy (i know it isn''t) phony that it bugs the heck out of me. The thing i find most disturbing of all is the fountain spouting water (the right word for it escapes me right now). It is so sinister-looking  that it reminds me of Anthony Perkins in Psycho when he came dashing into the shower. In fact, the only reason I could "read"  that sinister shape was because of the water on the lower left, which is really lovely the way it catches the light.<br/>Now, without the fountain and without the sunburst, a picture of just the sunset and the silhouette of the buildings with the interesting silhouettes of the towers would have been such a terrific shot. THEN,  that sunset would have looked indeed beautiful and a pleasure to behold. 5 Journey</td>', 'The title says beautiful but this picture does not come across as such to me. Too much of a good thing is sometimes ugly. And in this picture there is way too much. As a result, the sky looks a little garish; that "sunburst" looks so Photoshoppy (i know it isn''t) phony that it bugs the heck out of me. The thing i find most disturbing of all is the fountain spouting water (the right word for it escapes me right now). It is so sinister-looking  that it reminds me of Anthony Perkins in Psycho when he came dashing into the shower. In fact, the only reason I could "read"  that sinister shape was because of the water on the lower left, which is really lovely the way it catches the light.Now, without the fountain and without the sunburst, a picture of just the sunset and the silhouette of the buildings with the interesting silhouettes of the towers would have been such a terrific shot. THEN,  that sunset would have looked indeed beautiful and a pleasure to behold. 5 Journey', '2003-04-18 04:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(270077, 17707, 2586, '<td valign="top">This is such a cool image. Of all the pictures i have seen so far, it describes "weather" the best. I love all the distortions and i just FEEL this rotten weather and this storm right here at my monitor. Good choice to do this image in B&amp;W as it underscores the nasty weather. I''ll revisit this image lateron before voting ends. 8 Journey</td>', 'This is such a cool image. Of all the pictures i have seen so far, it describes "weather" the best. I love all the distortions and i just FEEL this rotten weather and this storm right here at my monitor. Good choice to do this image in B&W as it underscores the nasty weather. I''ll revisit this image lateron before voting ends. 8 Journey', '2003-04-18 04:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(270079, 18039, 2586, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t do much for me, probably because i have seen pictures from the side mirror a number of times now and once the novelty has worn off, there isn''t all that much interesting to look at. 5 Journey</td>', 'This doesn''t do much for me, probably because i have seen pictures from the side mirror a number of times now and once the novelty has worn off, there isn''t all that much interesting to look at. 5 Journey', '2003-04-18 04:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(270080, 17987, 6783, '<td valign="top">Funny.</td>', 'Funny.', '2003-04-18 04:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(270086, 18108, 2586, '<td valign="top">Nice image of a nasty subject. You sure this is ther esult of acid rain rather than the ubiquitous pests? :) The clarity of this image is just amazing: sharp detail of the leaf and  the rain drops. Also like the background: it is lively without being "busy". Nice composition with the diagonals of the branches. Good color combo of the dark green, the chartreuse green and the orangy rust tones. 8 Journey</td>', 'Nice image of a nasty subject. You sure this is ther esult of acid rain rather than the ubiquitous pests? :) The clarity of this image is just amazing: sharp detail of the leaf and  the rain drops. Also like the background: it is lively without being "busy". Nice composition with the diagonals of the branches. Good color combo of the dark green, the chartreuse green and the orangy rust tones. 8 Journey', '2003-04-18 04:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
