(270091, 18201, 2586, '<td valign="top">I am sure you will get a lot of comments asking whether you were really in Baghdad and i am one of those :) This is a nice picture with a great title. Would have preferred if you had rotated the image so that the tower would be perfectly vertical instead of tilted. I also find the crop at the bottom somewhat abrupt; probably to have seen more of the signage and the arabic lettering and perhaps the complete window would have given a more satisfying composition.  Good choice of the b&amp;w; it underscores the enormity of the events and changes that are taken place there right now. 7 Journey.</td>', 'I am sure you will get a lot of comments asking whether you were really in Baghdad and i am one of those :) This is a nice picture with a great title. Would have preferred if you had rotated the image so that the tower would be perfectly vertical instead of tilted. I also find the crop at the bottom somewhat abrupt; probably to have seen more of the signage and the arabic lettering and perhaps the complete window would have given a more satisfying composition.  Good choice of the b&w; it underscores the enormity of the events and changes that are taken place there right now. 7 Journey.', '2003-04-18 05:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(270092, 18233, 4517, '<td valign="top">My top scoring sunset pic in this challenge because it`s a bit more interesting with the fountain and star effect. Maybe a touch too dark but still a 9.</td>', 'My top scoring sunset pic in this challenge because it`s a bit more interesting with the fountain and star effect. Maybe a touch too dark but still a 9.', '2003-04-18 05:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(270093, 18122, 4517, '<td valign="top">Great detail. Doesn`t really look like it`s windy but still a good image.</td>', 'Great detail. Doesn`t really look like it`s windy but still a good image.', '2003-04-18 05:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(270095, 18081, 2586, '<td valign="top">Cruising through the thumbnails, i would say that this is one of my favorites. It is a very "clean" picture, not one of those gimmicky productions. Nice colors and contrasts.I love the rhythm of the composition of the sticks. They seem to do a dance and the fast moving clouds seem to be the "score".  Two minor nitpicks: 1) wished you had cropped out that little bit of dark on the right; it''s probably a tiny bit of another stick and it interferes with the overall nice rhythm a little 2) wish there weren''t those weeds in the bottom left corner - they don''t "belong" as they are another object and I really savor the simplicity of the few shapes, clouds and sticks against a blue sky. However, to have cropped them out would also lose the left stick which makes such a nice triangular shape and very necessary for the overall rhythm. 8 for now. Journey</td>', 'Cruising through the thumbnails, i would say that this is one of my favorites. It is a very "clean" picture, not one of those gimmicky productions. Nice colors and contrasts.I love the rhythm of the composition of the sticks. They seem to do a dance and the fast moving clouds seem to be the "score".  Two minor nitpicks: 1) wished you had cropped out that little bit of dark on the right; it''s probably a tiny bit of another stick and it interferes with the overall nice rhythm a little 2) wish there weren''t those weeds in the bottom left corner - they don''t "belong" as they are another object and I really savor the simplicity of the few shapes, clouds and sticks against a blue sky. However, to have cropped them out would also lose the left stick which makes such a nice triangular shape and very necessary for the overall rhythm. 8 for now. Journey', '2003-04-18 05:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(270099, 17684, 3540, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect and I really like the color tone of this photo.  The reflections in the pond/swamp are really eerie and make this shot.  NIce job</td>', 'Very cool effect and I really like the color tone of this photo.  The reflections in the pond/swamp are really eerie and make this shot.  NIce job', '2003-04-18 05:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
