(270316, 17987, 7033, '<td valign="top">Oooohhhh... sucks to be them!  :)  Not a bad shot, in my opinion, but seems to have a bit too much of a ''snapshot'' appearance to it.</td>', 'Oooohhhh... sucks to be them!  :)  Not a bad shot, in my opinion, but seems to have a bit too much of a ''snapshot'' appearance to it.', '2003-04-18 13:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
