(270337, 18016, 7536, '<td valign="top">It''s interestsing that the brush in the foreground is in focus while the clouds are slightly blurry. Nice effect.</td>', 'It''s interestsing that the brush in the foreground is in focus while the clouds are slightly blurry. Nice effect.', '2003-04-18 14:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
