(270346, 17684, 7536, '<td valign="top">Nice pic. A little too blue. Maybe black &amp; white to bring out the detail of the trees. Good job though.</td>', 'Nice pic. A little too blue. Maybe black & white to bring out the detail of the trees. Good job though.', '2003-04-18 14:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
