(270356, 17846, 7536, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you pointed out that it''s not black &amp; white. I forgot how dreary it gets up there sometimes. Nice balance in this photo. The tree and fence stand out well with the objects in the background.</td>', 'I''m glad you pointed out that it''s not black & white. I forgot how dreary it gets up there sometimes. Nice balance in this photo. The tree and fence stand out well with the objects in the background.', '2003-04-18 14:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(270357, 18227, 3037, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. I''m guessing that some of your comments will be about focus. A wider DOF might have had a better effect. Hopefully this isn''t you backyard! =-)</td>', 'Nice picture. I''m guessing that some of your comments will be about focus. A wider DOF might have had a better effect. Hopefully this isn''t you backyard! =-)', '2003-04-18 14:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
