(270509, 18265, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very pretty picture.  Is that a patch of sky above the fully displayed petal?  That was sarcastic, sorry, but this picture is all about the flower.  I know it takes weather to grow a flower, but it takes dirt, water, seeds and a whole lots of other things, too.  While this is an exceptionally pretty picture, I can''t give the higher end score due to the challenge.  Very nice texture and detail.  5 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very pretty picture.  Is that a patch of sky above the fully displayed petal?  That was sarcastic, sorry, but this picture is all about the flower.  I know it takes weather to grow a flower, but it takes dirt, water, seeds and a whole lots of other things, too.  While this is an exceptionally pretty picture, I can''t give the higher end score due to the challenge.  Very nice texture and detail.  5 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-18 17:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(270511, 18140, 7291, '<td valign="top">I love fog pictures.  This one is especially good.  I''m not so sure I like how the left rail is perfectly straight going up, it sort of slits the picture a bit.  Still one of my favorites though.  Looking at the tree in the upper right it looks like it was very windy also.</td>', 'I love fog pictures.  This one is especially good.  I''m not so sure I like how the left rail is perfectly straight going up, it sort of slits the picture a bit.  Still one of my favorites though.  Looking at the tree in the upper right it looks like it was very windy also.', '2003-04-18 17:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
