(270642, 17919, 6505, '<td valign="top">Oversharpened!  Colors needs more saturation too.  I would like to see more of the tree.  Nice clarity here and good angle.</td>', 'Oversharpened!  Colors needs more saturation too.  I would like to see more of the tree.  Nice clarity here and good angle.', '2003-04-18 21:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(270643, 18155, 6505, '<td valign="top">weird and interesting shot.  Lens glare here, probably due to the long exposure.  The exposure should be less for this.  Very interesting though</td>', 'weird and interesting shot.  Lens glare here, probably due to the long exposure.  The exposure should be less for this.  Very interesting though', '2003-04-18 21:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(270645, 17947, 6505, '<td valign="top">Thats a tree, and a small one at that.  If only i could see the weather.</td>', 'Thats a tree, and a small one at that.  If only i could see the weather.', '2003-04-18 21:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(270647, 18120, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good one!  The penny in there is real good.</td>', 'Good one!  The penny in there is real good.', '2003-04-18 21:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(270648, 18040, 6505, '<td valign="top">Very cleaver!  Technically, very nice shot although a little underexposed.</td>', 'Very cleaver!  Technically, very nice shot although a little underexposed.', '2003-04-18 21:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(270649, 18161, 6505, '<td valign="top">This is not weather, but its a great squirrel shot.  Dang! you missed the fauna challenge.</td>', 'This is not weather, but its a great squirrel shot.  Dang! you missed the fauna challenge.', '2003-04-18 21:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(270652, 18100, 6505, '<td valign="top">Almost perfect!  Needs just a little more clarity or some cleaning with neat image.</td>', 'Almost perfect!  Needs just a little more clarity or some cleaning with neat image.', '2003-04-18 21:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(270653, 17762, 6505, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Beautiful blues and white.  Others have tried to take pics of the ice and snow on trees, but this one is best by far!  Border works well too.  I wish i could figure borders out.  You clearly have.  Great job! 10!</td>', 'Very nice!  Beautiful blues and white.  Others have tried to take pics of the ice and snow on trees, but this one is best by far!  Border works well too.  I wish i could figure borders out.  You clearly have.  Great job! 10!', '2003-04-18 21:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(270654, 18152, 6505, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  You must have gotten pretty dirty.</td>', 'Great shot!  You must have gotten pretty dirty.', '2003-04-18 21:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(270656, 17915, 2158, '<td valign="top">I admire your creativity.  This is really good.</td>', 'I admire your creativity.  This is really good.', '2003-04-18 21:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(270657, 17920, 1280, '<td valign="top">Love it!! :-)</td>', 'Love it!! :-)', '2003-04-18 21:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(270658, 17889, 1280, '<td valign="top">Wow...this is so mysterious!  I am definetely curious about what is going on here. Meets challenge with the haze.</td>', 'Wow...this is so mysterious!  I am definetely curious about what is going on here. Meets challenge with the haze.', '2003-04-18 21:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(270659, 17847, 1280, '<td valign="top">Interesting one!</td>', 'Interesting one!', '2003-04-18 21:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(270660, 18241, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like that there is just enough light in the foreground to give a hint of texture.</td>', 'Very nice.  I like that there is just enough light in the foreground to give a hint of texture.', '2003-04-18 21:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(270661, 17798, 1280, '<td valign="top">Basically a lovely image.  You can rotate it with most photo editing programs, so your horizon does tilt.  Those clouds are wonderful!  :-)</td>', 'Basically a lovely image.  You can rotate it with most photo editing programs, so your horizon does tilt.  Those clouds are wonderful!  :-)', '2003-04-18 21:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(270662, 18233, 2158, '<td valign="top">The left side of this picture is great.  I''m not too keen on the fountain (?) on the right.  It almost looks like a dirty spot on the lens.</td>', 'The left side of this picture is great.  I''m not too keen on the fountain (?) on the right.  It almost looks like a dirty spot on the lens.', '2003-04-18 21:59:31.000000', NULL, 1);
