(270687, 17642, 3746, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, but not overly inspiring.. The blackband (window frame) on the left of the picture does you no favours at all on this picture, try cropping your photos down so they appear more pleasing (in most of my photos I usually crop about 50 - 70 percent of the original photo out)..</td>', 'Meets the challenge, but not overly inspiring.. The blackband (window frame) on the left of the picture does you no favours at all on this picture, try cropping your photos down so they appear more pleasing (in most of my photos I usually crop about 50 - 70 percent of the original photo out)..', '2003-04-18 22:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
