(270694, 17690, 3746, '<td valign="top">Thanks god, just when I thought I would be forever looking at pictures of sunsets and snow, someone actually posts a picture that "shows the effects of weather", and its a great photo as well!!!  I love the use of duotones, of which I am a big fan (plain B&amp;W doesn''t do it for me baby!!!)... This may be my only 10 this week, WELL DONE!!!!!!! (and thanks for saving my sanity!)</td>', 'Thanks god, just when I thought I would be forever looking at pictures of sunsets and snow, someone actually posts a picture that "shows the effects of weather", and its a great photo as well!!!  I love the use of duotones, of which I am a big fan (plain B&W doesn''t do it for me baby!!!)... This may be my only 10 this week, WELL DONE!!!!!!! (and thanks for saving my sanity!)', '2003-04-18 22:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(270695, 18086, 3746, '<td valign="top">I like the attempt at trying something different.. To be truthful though, the shot is actually below what I would call average.. But I''ll give you a 6 for TRYING something different.. Good luck!</td>', 'I like the attempt at trying something different.. To be truthful though, the shot is actually below what I would call average.. But I''ll give you a 6 for TRYING something different.. Good luck!', '2003-04-18 22:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
