(270697, 17681, 7204, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture!  :)  I like the cllubhouse in the background - I like that you can just barely see it.  I would have focused more on that than the flag.</td>', 'Excellent picture!  :)  I like the cllubhouse in the background - I like that you can just barely see it.  I would have focused more on that than the flag.', '2003-04-18 22:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
