(271121, 17956, 6325, '<td valign="top">Very good shot. I like the little flash o flight on the dog next to the person wlaking on the beach.</td>', 'Very good shot. I like the little flash o flight on the dog next to the person wlaking on the beach.', '2003-04-19 23:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
