(271206, 17628, 6172, '<td valign="top">This probably looks much better in a larger version!  Nice shot, just doesn''t get what it deserves at this size.</td>', 'This probably looks much better in a larger version!  Nice shot, just doesn''t get what it deserves at this size.', '2003-04-20 01:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
