(271218, 18256, 6325, '<td valign="top">Really like the monochrome with the bright tail lights. Well done.</td>', 'Really like the monochrome with the bright tail lights. Well done.', '2003-04-20 01:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(271222, 18152, 7706, '<td valign="top">that would look great on a wall, or even as the back drop of one of those inspirational posters that have poems on them :)</td>', 'that would look great on a wall, or even as the back drop of one of those inspirational posters that have poems on them :)', '2003-04-20 01:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(271223, 17923, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good subject for the challenge. Love the location. The image could have been processed to bring out more intensity in the wood tones.</td>', 'Good subject for the challenge. Love the location. The image could have been processed to bring out more intensity in the wood tones.', '2003-04-20 01:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(271224, 17855, 7706, '<td valign="top">I love that tree, it has great lines. I kind of wish it was just the tree and the sky</td>', 'I love that tree, it has great lines. I kind of wish it was just the tree and the sky', '2003-04-20 01:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(271226, 17632, 7706, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, and the purples :)</td>', 'I love this shot, and the purples :)', '2003-04-20 01:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(271227, 17713, 7706, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, because its totally different to the other 229 photos.</td>', 'I love this shot, because its totally different to the other 229 photos.', '2003-04-20 01:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(271229, 17946, 6325, '<td valign="top">Higher contrast would have made this pop.</td>', 'Higher contrast would have made this pop.', '2003-04-20 01:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(271232, 17816, 7706, '<td valign="top">what is the white section for?</td>', 'what is the white section for?', '2003-04-20 01:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(271233, 18160, 3710, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2003-04-20 02:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(271236, 18160, 6325, '<td valign="top">One of the very few that really shows weather.</td>', 'One of the very few that really shows weather.', '2003-04-20 02:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(271238, 18118, 7706, '<td valign="top">what city is this? Its a great photo. I love the reflection on the water :)</td>', 'what city is this? Its a great photo. I love the reflection on the water :)', '2003-04-20 02:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(271241, 17912, 7706, '<td valign="top">I like the emotion this photo has. The colors are grayish, and the horse has its head pointing down, it looks sad, so goes well with the rain theme</td>', 'I like the emotion this photo has. The colors are grayish, and the horse has its head pointing down, it looks sad, so goes well with the rain theme', '2003-04-20 02:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(271242, 18244, 6674, '<td valign="top">Did you climb a tree for this?? :) Great idea!</td>', 'Did you climb a tree for this?? :) Great idea!', '2003-04-20 02:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(271243, 17742, 2586, '<td valign="top">If you meant by the title that it is always summer in the Sahara, fine. Otherwise, the picture would fall outside the timeframe allowed for making the picture :) I like the colors: the orange and its complement, blue. Nice motion in the dune and in the wispy clouds. Wish this image had been a bit bigger. 7 Journey</td>', 'If you meant by the title that it is always summer in the Sahara, fine. Otherwise, the picture would fall outside the timeframe allowed for making the picture :) I like the colors: the orange and its complement, blue. Nice motion in the dune and in the wispy clouds. Wish this image had been a bit bigger. 7 Journey', '2003-04-20 02:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(271244, 17919, 2586, '<td valign="top">Pleasant landscape, exudes tranquility. Good colors.That light brown undefineable mass adjacent to the treetrunk is somewhat distracting,probably because it is so hard to read what it is exactly but you had no control over it anyway. 7 Journey</td>', 'Pleasant landscape, exudes tranquility. Good colors.That light brown undefineable mass adjacent to the treetrunk is somewhat distracting,probably because it is so hard to read what it is exactly but you had no control over it anyway. 7 Journey', '2003-04-20 02:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(271245, 18132, 2586, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t do much for me, i''m afraid. It''s all a little static and lifeless. Cropped off a little erratically at the top; the light on Roma is pretty uneven. 4 Journey</td>', 'This doesn''t do much for me, i''m afraid. It''s all a little static and lifeless. Cropped off a little erratically at the top; the light on Roma is pretty uneven. 4 Journey', '2003-04-20 02:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(271246, 17660, 2586, '<td valign="top">Don''t particularly care for the colors. Colors in nature never jar and yet here they do a little. There are also too many objects to really grab me, brown dead leaves, bright green leaves, very colorful red and yellow flowers and the ivy against a very obscure background. 5 Journey</td>', 'Don''t particularly care for the colors. Colors in nature never jar and yet here they do a little. There are also too many objects to really grab me, brown dead leaves, bright green leaves, very colorful red and yellow flowers and the ivy against a very obscure background. 5 Journey', '2003-04-20 03:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(271247, 18141, 2586, '<td valign="top">Judging by the ferns, i venture to say this scene is from the Pac NW. I love the water and the detail of the rocks in the foreground. That black boulder on the right is lovely. The ferns and the area above the water makes the overall scene a little busy for my taste, the more so since there is so much detail, texture and color variations elsewhere. 7 Journey</td>', 'Judging by the ferns, i venture to say this scene is from the Pac NW. I love the water and the detail of the rocks in the foreground. That black boulder on the right is lovely. The ferns and the area above the water makes the overall scene a little busy for my taste, the more so since there is so much detail, texture and color variations elsewhere. 7 Journey', '2003-04-20 03:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(271248, 17867, 2586, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape! Good composition. Like the detail of the water and the bark. Good colors. 7 Journey</td>', 'Nice landscape! Good composition. Like the detail of the water and the bark. Good colors. 7 Journey', '2003-04-20 03:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(271252, 18092, 2586, '<td valign="top">Endearing portrait. And that''s coming from someone who normally doesn''t care much about pictures of children! I like how the child intently contemplates the daisy it''s playing with. Like the setting of the image as well with the joyous abundance of daisies. Two nitpicks: the light on the right arm seems off and a little washed out; and too bad the yellow flower growing out of its head.7 Journey</td>', 'Endearing portrait. And that''s coming from someone who normally doesn''t care much about pictures of children! I like how the child intently contemplates the daisy it''s playing with. Like the setting of the image as well with the joyous abundance of daisies. Two nitpicks: the light on the right arm seems off and a little washed out; and too bad the yellow flower growing out of its head.7 Journey', '2003-04-20 03:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(271253, 18151, 2586, '<td valign="top">I always get a big kick out of these particular clouds with the light just gushing out. And you captured it quite well. As a result, the lighting on the trees rather suffered and it rendered their shapes rather unappealing; so little of the trees showing too. Good effort. 5 Journey</td>', 'I always get a big kick out of these particular clouds with the light just gushing out. And you captured it quite well. As a result, the lighting on the trees rather suffered and it rendered their shapes rather unappealing; so little of the trees showing too. Good effort. 5 Journey', '2003-04-20 03:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(271262, 18122, 4767, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous macro shot!!!!This is exquisite!</td>', 'Gorgeous macro shot!!!!This is exquisite!', '2003-04-20 04:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(271284, 18250, 7655, '<td valign="top">real pretty! the colors and shadows (not to mention the cavern''s good looks) make this a truly cool pic! the silhouette in the front kinda spoils it a little, though... i would''ve liked it better if it weren''t there or if it had a little detail but dark, of course.</td>', 'real pretty! the colors and shadows (not to mention the cavern''s good looks) make this a truly cool pic! the silhouette in the front kinda spoils it a little, though... i would''ve liked it better if it weren''t there or if it had a little detail but dark, of course.', '2003-04-20 07:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(271286, 18269, 4411, '<td valign="top">Love how you''ve made the ground so small in the shot, yet it still has depth to it. Great sky.</td>', 'Love how you''ve made the ground so small in the shot, yet it still has depth to it. Great sky.', '2003-04-20 07:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(271289, 17921, 4411, '<td valign="top">Stunning. I think I''d prefer it with the water(?) at the bottom cropped out, but this is still a great shot. Well done.</td>', 'Stunning. I think I''d prefer it with the water(?) at the bottom cropped out, but this is still a great shot. Well done.', '2003-04-20 07:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(271292, 18112, 1707, '<td valign="top">excellent! love the distance and sense of layer in this picture!</td>', 'excellent! love the distance and sense of layer in this picture!', '2003-04-20 09:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(271295, 18182, 1826, '<td valign="top">Simply Beautiful! 10</td>', 'Simply Beautiful! 10', '2003-04-20 10:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(271297, 17919, 5792, '<td valign="top">The tree is clearly a good subject for this challenge. The flowers contrast the fallen tree. This might work better if you could somehow get a different angle, either from the side or lower looking upward to emphasize the "falleness" of the tree against the "normal" surroundings and hotizon.</td>', 'The tree is clearly a good subject for this challenge. The flowers contrast the fallen tree. This might work better if you could somehow get a different angle, either from the side or lower looking upward to emphasize the "falleness" of the tree against the "normal" surroundings and hotizon.', '2003-04-20 10:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(271298, 18238, 1826, '<td valign="top">Great color!</td>', 'Great color!', '2003-04-20 10:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(271299, 17884, 1826, '<td valign="top">This is so cool- Love the perspective- nice work!</td>', 'This is so cool- Love the perspective- nice work!', '2003-04-20 10:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(271300, 17953, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. The clarity of the electric cloud contrasts well against the soft focus and color of the nearer clouds</td>', 'Nicely done. The clarity of the electric cloud contrasts well against the soft focus and color of the nearer clouds', '2003-04-20 10:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(271301, 18160, 5792, '<td valign="top">A terrific conveyance for a spring rain. Very well done.</td>', 'A terrific conveyance for a spring rain. Very well done.', '2003-04-20 10:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(271302, 18233, 5792, '<td valign="top">Never been to UT campus, but it looks mighty inviting in this image. Wonderful sillouette of the setting sun. The fountain makes a nice foreground focal point against the campus skyline.</td>', 'Never been to UT campus, but it looks mighty inviting in this image. Wonderful sillouette of the setting sun. The fountain makes a nice foreground focal point against the campus skyline.', '2003-04-20 10:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(271303, 18108, 5792, '<td valign="top">Color and composition are outstanding in this image.</td>', 'Color and composition are outstanding in this image.', '2003-04-20 10:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
