(271380, 17907, 8037, '<td valign="top">I would not classify this image as weather. But would as nature or flowers.<br/>As far as the image goes I think it is a pretty good one DOF is week on the sides, or the branch was  moving and shutter speed was not fast enough to make a sharp image overall. That makes the sharp in focus part smack dap in the middle both directions and is a no no in composition rules. Rules can be broken, the image is pleasing, but because of the things I have mention have mark it lower than it probally deserves.</td>', 'I would not classify this image as weather. But would as nature or flowers.As far as the image goes I think it is a pretty good one DOF is week on the sides, or the branch was  moving and shutter speed was not fast enough to make a sharp image overall. That makes the sharp in focus part smack dap in the middle both directions and is a no no in composition rules. Rules can be broken, the image is pleasing, but because of the things I have mention have mark it lower than it probally deserves.', '2003-04-20 13:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
