(271384, 18118, 8037, '<td valign="top">Because in order to get great sunsets you need "overcast" or clouds in the right spots to reflect color I would not say this really shows weather as the subject matter really asks. However, as an image it is very pleasing and I love the silloutes. it seems that the skyline goes down hill and is in the middle of the image. Horizon or skyline should be on the thirds no on the middle... Good job</td>', 'Because in order to get great sunsets you need "overcast" or clouds in the right spots to reflect color I would not say this really shows weather as the subject matter really asks. However, as an image it is very pleasing and I love the silloutes. it seems that the skyline goes down hill and is in the middle of the image. Horizon or skyline should be on the thirds no on the middle... Good job', '2003-04-20 13:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
