(271499, 18086, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting twist on the challenge... I hope that your interpretation doesn''t cost you too much on the vote :) - setzler</td>', 'interesting twist on the challenge... I hope that your interpretation doesn''t cost you too much on the vote :) - setzler', '2003-04-20 17:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
