(271716, 18242, 5822, '<td valign="top">Compositionally I would have preferred for you not to cut off the rocks in the lower right hand corner, as well as, to crop out the upper third of the photo. I don''t think it adds anything to see above the area of the ocean where it changes color from light to darker blue. This picture has a lot of potential and I love the vivid blue colors and the how you captured the mirror like quality of the water on the sand in the mid forground, just above the rocks.</td>', 'Compositionally I would have preferred for you not to cut off the rocks in the lower right hand corner, as well as, to crop out the upper third of the photo. I don''t think it adds anything to see above the area of the ocean where it changes color from light to darker blue. This picture has a lot of potential and I love the vivid blue colors and the how you captured the mirror like quality of the water on the sand in the mid forground, just above the rocks.', '2003-04-21 00:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(271718, 17848, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great catch, and I like what you did with the different shades of blue here. Very nicely done.</td>', 'Wow! Great catch, and I like what you did with the different shades of blue here. Very nicely done.', '2003-04-21 00:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
