(271721, 18246, 5822, '<td valign="top">Compositioinally I find the power lines to be distracting. At first, I didn''t like the blue you added to the clouds and found it to be unnatural, but after looking at the photo for some time, I don''t find it objectionable and think it adds interest to the bands of green and yellow in the pic.</td>', 'Compositioinally I find the power lines to be distracting. At first, I didn''t like the blue you added to the clouds and found it to be unnatural, but after looking at the photo for some time, I don''t find it objectionable and think it adds interest to the bands of green and yellow in the pic.', '2003-04-21 00:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(271726, 18260, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wonderful vivid colors and compositional props that certainly evoke a feeling of a certain kind of weather. If I have any issue it''s that the colors may be a bit too saturated for my liking. For instance, I find the red cap to the suntan lotion to be bright. Hey, how about a beach date? :)</td>', 'Wonderful vivid colors and compositional props that certainly evoke a feeling of a certain kind of weather. If I have any issue it''s that the colors may be a bit too saturated for my liking. For instance, I find the red cap to the suntan lotion to be bright. Hey, how about a beach date? :)', '2003-04-21 00:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
