(271780, 18201, 2586, '<td valign="top">Magnetic, you dirty rat, i feel cheated! lol. I really assumed that this was shot in Baghdad and that intrigued me a great deal. But no, you were just playing some lousy photojournalism tricks with a catchy title and it was just a shot of a local run of the mill mosque. Oh, come on! :) I hope you realize i''m just giving you a rough time. It IS a beautiful image and it grows on me.</td>', 'Magnetic, you dirty rat, i feel cheated! lol. I really assumed that this was shot in Baghdad and that intrigued me a great deal. But no, you were just playing some lousy photojournalism tricks with a catchy title and it was just a shot of a local run of the mill mosque. Oh, come on! :) I hope you realize i''m just giving you a rough time. It IS a beautiful image and it grows on me.', '2003-04-21 01:22:36.000000', NULL, 0),
