(271829, 17707, 2586, '<td valign="top">I feel this image too is way underrated. Granted the scene it depicts is rather "snapshotty" (well, heck, you took it from a parking lot) but the weather effect is great due to all the distortions. And rather than the image being depressing, it has a playful, fun appearance. I really liked it!</td>', 'I feel this image too is way underrated. Granted the scene it depicts is rather "snapshotty" (well, heck, you took it from a parking lot) but the weather effect is great due to all the distortions. And rather than the image being depressing, it has a playful, fun appearance. I really liked it!', '2003-04-21 01:45:20.000000', NULL, 0),
