(271892, 18233, 2586, '<td valign="top">You probably found my comment harsh and attributed that to my usual undiplomatic bluntness but i just want to say it was very deliberate. I relished making the comment [evil grin]. The title lead me to believe it was shot with either an EOS D60 or with a 10D (although i probably might have suspected that anyway). And i find it only fair to hold that dslr crowd to a much, much higher standard! Too bad about the distractions because the colors of that sky are just extraordinary!</td>', 'You probably found my comment harsh and attributed that to my usual undiplomatic bluntness but i just want to say it was very deliberate. I relished making the comment [evil grin]. The title lead me to believe it was shot with either an EOS D60 or with a 10D (although i probably might have suspected that anyway). And i find it only fair to hold that dslr crowd to a much, much higher standard! Too bad about the distractions because the colors of that sky are just extraordinary!', '2003-04-21 02:06:00.000000', NULL, 0),
