(271950, 18149, 7106, '<td valign="top">I''d like to thank the people that feel horses are a part of the environment. I guess I didn''t read the challenge the same way everyone else did. I should have just taken a picture of a sunset. <br/> <br/>I do agree that it could have been cropped differently. I didn''t take this specifically for the challenge, but did take it that week and thought it fit. I didn''t crop it at all, just resized it.<br/> <br/>?? Details: Try photographing weather or the EFFECTS weather can have on the ENVIRONMENT. Good luck.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-04-21 02:11:47.</i></td>', 'I''d like to thank the people that feel horses are a part of the environment. I guess I didn''t read the challenge the same way everyone else did. I should have just taken a picture of a sunset.  I do agree that it could have been cropped differently. I didn''t take this specifically for the challenge, but did take it that week and thought it fit. I didn''t crop it at all, just resized it. ?? Details: Try photographing weather or the EFFECTS weather can have on the ENVIRONMENT. Good luck.', '2003-04-21 03:07:18.000000', '2003-04-21 03:11:47.000000', 0),
