(271961, 18233, 2923, '<td valign="top">well, i should''ve used a wide angle if i wanted to include the fountain -- but the real issue is that i was waiting for them to turn the damn fountain light on!  It''d be a very different photo if it was on, they did turn it on but that was past sunset.  It''s a classic problem -- expose for the fountain or expose for the sunset.<br/> <br/>If you look in my portfolio you will find other shots I took WITHOUT the fountain.  No desire to enter it as a submission though :)<br/></td>', 'well, i should''ve used a wide angle if i wanted to include the fountain -- but the real issue is that i was waiting for them to turn the damn fountain light on!  It''d be a very different photo if it was on, they did turn it on but that was past sunset.  It''s a classic problem -- expose for the fountain or expose for the sunset. If you look in my portfolio you will find other shots I took WITHOUT the fountain.  No desire to enter it as a submission though :)', '2003-04-21 03:23:19.000000', NULL, 0),
