(272094, 18201, 472, '<td valign="top">well, in actuality, it''s a totally spectacular mosque in Washington DC.  However, I feel that this image did in fact symbolically represent to me the current transitional climate in the middle east, and I wanted to make that statement, hence my title.  <br/> <br/>License with titles is the norm on this site. the second place winner''s bush was not in fact "burning".  The 3rd place candy winner was not in fact shot at ''candy mountain''.  My own candy image "Lollystop" is not a real stop sign.  there have been staged images of prostitution, robbery, kidnapping, and rape on this site, none of which purport to be the ''real deal''.  since this is not a documentary site or a news organization, that''s the name of the game - painting with images and words to create an effect or message.  So don''t feel cheated.</td>', 'well, in actuality, it''s a totally spectacular mosque in Washington DC.  However, I feel that this image did in fact symbolically represent to me the current transitional climate in the middle east, and I wanted to make that statement, hence my title.   License with titles is the norm on this site. the second place winner''s bush was not in fact "burning".  The 3rd place candy winner was not in fact shot at ''candy mountain''.  My own candy image "Lollystop" is not a real stop sign.  there have been staged images of prostitution, robbery, kidnapping, and rape on this site, none of which purport to be the ''real deal''.  since this is not a documentary site or a news organization, that''s the name of the game - painting with images and words to create an effect or message.  So don''t feel cheated.', '2003-04-21 09:37:44.000000', NULL, 0),
