(272944, 18275, 327, '<td valign="top"><b>CC ~Good evening to you tcherring</b> <br/> <br/>Fits The Challenge- O'' yeah!<br/>Composition-Good <br/>Background-Good <br/>My Opinion- Dramatic photo. Storm coming. If I still lived in Oklahoma and saw that I''d be going to the cellar!! I think the colors could of been enhanced a little by adjusting the saturation some. I think you hit a _bulls eye_ on the challenge. Overall a very nice shot. Good execution.</td>', 'CC ~Good evening to you tcherring  Fits The Challenge- O'' yeah!Composition-Good Background-Good My Opinion- Dramatic photo. Storm coming. If I still lived in Oklahoma and saw that I''d be going to the cellar!! I think the colors could of been enhanced a little by adjusting the saturation some. I think you hit a _bulls eye_ on the challenge. Overall a very nice shot. Good execution.', '2003-04-21 23:19:57.000000', NULL, 0),
