(273097, 17956, 7021, '<td valign="top">I''m disapointed in the result of this photo.  This was definately my pick for first place, but people are so fickle with exposure, and tend to forget that under/overexposing a photograph is often beneficial to the composition as this image''s dark side and light side contrast the bright sunshine with the dark storm.</td>', 'I''m disapointed in the result of this photo.  This was definately my pick for first place, but people are so fickle with exposure, and tend to forget that under/overexposing a photograph is often beneficial to the composition as this image''s dark side and light side contrast the bright sunshine with the dark storm.', '2003-04-22 02:53:52.000000', NULL, 0),
