(273612, 18244, 772, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club :)<br/> <br/>Hi Doug...<br/> <br/>This is a very interesting concept for the weather challenge :)  You have creatively constructed a situation where it looks like the photo was taken from a kite :)  This is one of the more unique perspectives I have seen on this challenge.... great idea :)<br/> <br/>I don''t think there was a lot you could do to improve this photo.  There is nothing wrong with it at all... The only possiblities would have been greater distance between you and the end of the string, but that is not likely possible...<br/> <br/>Great work as usual :)  You have a very creative mind :)<br/> <br/>John Setzler<br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club :) Hi Doug... This is a very interesting concept for the weather challenge :)  You have creatively constructed a situation where it looks like the photo was taken from a kite :)  This is one of the more unique perspectives I have seen on this challenge.... great idea :) I don''t think there was a lot you could do to improve this photo.  There is nothing wrong with it at all... The only possiblities would have been greater distance between you and the end of the string, but that is not likely possible... Great work as usual :)  You have a very creative mind :) John Setzler', '2003-04-22 15:15:00.000000', NULL, 0),
