(273691, 18049, 714, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your wonderful comments.<br/> <br/>Some of you stated that I should have taken off my shoes, well the thought did cross my mind but after running back and forth to set the timer and run back to my spot I decided against it.  To many cactis'' <br/>I am one who can''t even walk in grass with bare feet.  Ouch!<br/>I am not sure why there is a pink hue in the sky.  I think it is because we have a lot of methane work going on and big trucks kick up the scorio dust.  Which is red dirt. ????<br/>Sonja</td>', 'Thank you all for your wonderful comments. Some of you stated that I should have taken off my shoes, well the thought did cross my mind but after running back and forth to set the timer and run back to my spot I decided against it.  To many cactis'' I am one who can''t even walk in grass with bare feet.  Ouch!I am not sure why there is a pink hue in the sky.  I think it is because we have a lot of methane work going on and big trucks kick up the scorio dust.  Which is red dirt. ????Sonja', '2003-04-22 16:37:27.000000', NULL, 0),
