(289459, 17924, 1005, '<td valign="top">Ehh, people are so silly!  Why do they feel the need for colors to be "average".  This photo was probably taken about an hour or so before sunset, that gives the cloud tops a yellow tint (we do have a yellow sun, no?)  The trees shouldn''t be in focus, they aren''t the subject!  I like the patch of blue - says to me..it was nice, but it''s going downhill.  I gave this a 7.  A little more drama would have placed this in my upper grouping.</td>', 'Ehh, people are so silly!  Why do they feel the need for colors to be "average".  This photo was probably taken about an hour or so before sunset, that gives the cloud tops a yellow tint (we do have a yellow sun, no?)  The trees shouldn''t be in focus, they aren''t the subject!  I like the patch of blue - says to me..it was nice, but it''s going downhill.  I gave this a 7.  A little more drama would have placed this in my upper grouping.', '2003-05-06 17:11:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(289551, 17921, 7801, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Inga_fang:</b></div><hr/><i>my friend wants this on her wall....will u b putting it on dpcprints??</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Shall be joining soon, I''ll then put it up on dpprints..... I''l let you know.</td>', 'Originally posted by Inga_fang:my friend wants this on her wall....will u b putting it on dpcprints??  Shall be joining soon, I''ll then put it up on dpprints..... I''l let you know.', '2003-05-06 18:57:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(292231, 18219, 1202, '<td valign="top">Shari,<br/>Thanks for the review of my buzzard shot.  I agree that a tighter crop would have been more effective.   As it is this rendition only represents about 25% of the original picture and it was starting to break up, so I stopped with what I entered.   I surely wish that I could have been closer, but it wasn''t my day.<br/>Thanks to you and the rest of the CC for your extra effort and time.<br/>Keep up the good work and have fun!<br/>Dick</td>', 'Shari,Thanks for the review of my buzzard shot.  I agree that a tighter crop would have been more effective.   As it is this rendition only represents about 25% of the original picture and it was starting to break up, so I stopped with what I entered.   I surely wish that I could have been closer, but it wasn''t my day.Thanks to you and the rest of the CC for your extra effort and time.Keep up the good work and have fun!Dick', '2003-05-08 15:07:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(293865, 17684, 6548, '<td valign="top">I really appreciate all the comments on the photo. I tried this pic a couple different ways, less blue, no blue, more contast, less contrast, level adjustments, but I just kept coming back to the original, can''t beat that!</td>', 'I really appreciate all the comments on the photo. I tried this pic a couple different ways, less blue, no blue, more contast, less contrast, level adjustments, but I just kept coming back to the original, can''t beat that!', '2003-05-09 23:10:41.000000', NULL, 0),
